1
00:01:58,874 --> 00:02:11,274
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:11,926 --> 00:02:13,485
Osman Bey!

3
00:02:20,086 --> 00:02:25,685
You were talking about a sovereign Beylic.
You said you would walk alone.

4
00:02:26,486 --> 00:02:28,605
This is loneliness.

5
00:02:32,846 --> 00:02:38,685
You cannot even protect Sogut which
was entrusted to you by your father.

6
00:02:39,166 --> 00:02:43,085
-What are you going to do now, Osman Bey?
-Yakup Bey!

7
00:02:43,526 --> 00:02:49,165
We will neither entrust these lands to those
who pretend to be good but draw daggers...

8
00:02:49,446 --> 00:02:54,885
...nor to the oppressor, don't worry.

9
00:02:55,286 --> 00:03:00,405
I am not the one whose homeland
was attacked, Osman Bey.

10
00:03:01,886 --> 00:03:04,365
I am not worried.

11
00:03:04,686 --> 00:03:08,965
That sword is on our neck
because we stood against...

12
00:03:08,966 --> 00:03:12,525
...the cruel, because we ruined their game.

13
00:03:13,526 --> 00:03:19,885
You can bow down as you always do, Yakup Bey.

14
00:03:21,486 --> 00:03:25,205
You might live long then.

15
00:03:28,006 --> 00:03:30,805
Alps! Let's go!

16
00:03:49,206 --> 00:03:52,445
Go, Osman... Go.

17
00:03:53,006 --> 00:03:59,805
You will cause many other
problems with that mindset.

18
00:04:03,006 --> 00:04:05,365
-Kanyumaz!
-My Sultan.

19
00:04:05,486 --> 00:04:08,765
Gather all the traders and shopkeepers.

20
00:04:09,166 --> 00:04:14,445
-I have things to say.
-Yes, my Sultan.

21
00:04:27,766 --> 00:04:33,925
He is always waiting in ambush.
He wants us to lose our balance.

22
00:04:34,166 --> 00:04:40,165
We will not fall, Malhun. No matter
what they do, we will stand against them.

23
00:04:41,966 --> 00:04:46,525
Let's wait for Osman Bey to go to Sogut.

24
00:04:52,886 --> 00:05:00,045
Osman! He took the Princess. He fooled us.

25
00:05:00,126 --> 00:05:05,085
Destroy Sogut!

26
00:05:22,566 --> 00:05:26,525
The people of Yenisehir!
You are all...

27
00:05:26,606 --> 00:05:32,725
...honest traders who are making
great effort to earn halal income.

28
00:05:32,926 --> 00:05:39,125
But... they will even make trades haram for you.

29
00:05:39,246 --> 00:05:44,245
Mongols attacked Sogut.

30
00:05:44,926 --> 00:05:49,965
They can attack Yenisehir anytime.

31
00:05:53,766 --> 00:05:59,645
Osman Bey's moves will put you in trouble.

32
00:06:01,206 --> 00:06:06,365
Listen to me carefully. Your
caravans will be attacked.

33
00:06:06,486 --> 00:06:10,125
Your marketplaces will be raided.

34
00:06:10,206 --> 00:06:15,845
What are you trying to say,
Yakup Bey? Say it directly!

35
00:06:18,006 --> 00:06:22,645
I am trying to say... Traders..

36
00:06:22,686 --> 00:06:27,885
...do not let your Bey use
you for the duality he caused.

37
00:06:28,686 --> 00:06:33,365
Bring your goods to the frontiers marketplace.

38
00:06:33,766 --> 00:06:35,405
Yakup Bey!

39
00:06:36,886 --> 00:06:41,645
While the oppressors are raiding
your brother's homeland, not going...

40
00:06:41,686 --> 00:06:44,845
...to war with them and
trying to gain power here...

41
00:06:47,126 --> 00:06:50,405
...right. It would only suit someone like you.

42
00:06:50,486 --> 00:06:56,125
Those who chose loneliness
while all the people...

43
00:06:56,366 --> 00:07:02,805
...united behind a Sultan pay
the price for their actions alone.

44
00:07:09,606 --> 00:07:16,725
But... there is no need for
our people to pay for this.

45
00:07:18,086 --> 00:07:23,485
I will save them from your hands.

46
00:07:26,366 --> 00:07:31,885
People of Yenisehir! From now on...

47
00:07:32,126 --> 00:07:37,605
...you will not pay a single
tax in the frontiers marketplace.

48
00:07:43,006 --> 00:07:45,645
Thanks to Allah! We will not pay any taxes!

49
00:07:45,726 --> 00:07:49,005
And the safety of your caravans...

50
00:07:49,366 --> 00:07:53,285
...will be provided by Germiyan Alps.

51
00:07:59,886 --> 00:08:03,725
Do not entrust your life and
goods to miserable people...

52
00:08:03,806 --> 00:08:07,005
...who cannot even protect...

53
00:08:07,046 --> 00:08:10,845
..their ancestral homeland.

54
00:08:11,086 --> 00:08:15,125
Yakup Bey is telling the truth!
-Yakup Bey!

55
00:08:15,686 --> 00:08:18,445
Do your best!

56
00:08:18,646 --> 00:08:23,125
Neither we nor our people
will fall for these games!

57
00:08:23,286 --> 00:08:26,525
Come on! You are free to go!

58
00:09:08,806 --> 00:09:12,925
Come on!

59
00:09:44,206 --> 00:09:48,925
They burnt it down, Osman
Bey... They burnt it down.

60
00:10:01,966 --> 00:10:05,925
Indeed, to Allah we belong
and to Allah we shall return/'

61
00:10:17,246 --> 00:10:20,565
You will recover..

62
00:10:20,886 --> 00:10:25,605
We will recover... We will
recover. Don't worry. Alps!

63
00:10:25,806 --> 00:10:29,205
Check the injured ones.

64
00:10:39,726 --> 00:10:43,965
Check everyone! Check the injured ones!

65
00:10:44,486 --> 00:10:45,565
Alps!

66
00:10:49,566 --> 00:10:55,605
What am I going to do? My son..

67
00:11:32,926 --> 00:11:39,805
Don't worry... For sure, we will get
over this. We will treat all our wounds.

68
00:12:01,006 --> 00:12:06,765
What happened here?
What happened here?

69
00:12:14,046 --> 00:12:19,245
Indeed, to Allah we belong
and to Allah we shall return/'

70
00:12:22,166 --> 00:12:28,165
Alps... Alps! My valiants...

71
00:12:36,526 --> 00:12:40,005
My dear... My dear...

72
00:12:42,126 --> 00:12:43,725
My dear...

73
00:12:59,086 --> 00:13:00,405
My dear...

74
00:13:18,406 --> 00:13:22,845
You killed my innocent
people because you could not...

75
00:13:22,926 --> 00:13:29,085
...take the Princess. You killed my people!

76
00:13:29,446 --> 00:13:34,165
Gorklu Khan! I swear!

77
00:13:34,366 --> 00:13:39,365
I will make you pay for this! Here!

78
00:13:40,086 --> 00:13:43,525
May this baby be my witness!

79
00:13:44,926 --> 00:13:54,005
I will take my revenge from you in
such a way that... In such a way that...

80
00:14:03,646 --> 00:14:08,285
My dear baby... My dear...

81
00:14:08,446 --> 00:14:11,765
Alaeddin.. -My Bey.

82
00:14:13,286 --> 00:14:16,245
-Heal the wounds of all the injured.
-EyvAllah my Bey.

83
00:14:38,726 --> 00:14:40,405
People!

84
00:14:43,926 --> 00:14:46,365
Do not worry!

85
00:14:48,406 --> 00:14:52,245
We will have those dogs..

86
00:14:52,646 --> 00:14:57,165
Pay hundred times more!

87
00:14:57,246 --> 00:14:59,045
-Samil.
-My Bey.

88
00:14:59,326 --> 00:15:03,845
See to everyone needs with the dervish lodge.

89
00:15:03,966 --> 00:15:08,125
As you command, my bey.

90
00:15:08,526 --> 00:15:13,765
My bey. My bey, we couldn't do it.

91
00:15:14,126 --> 00:15:17,565
We couldn't protect our ancestor's lands.

92
00:15:17,646 --> 00:15:23,725
They came so suddenly, my bey.
We tried holding them, however..

93
00:15:24,166 --> 00:15:27,925
People from one side alps from another..

94
00:15:28,086 --> 00:15:31,325
We couldn't my bey, we couldn't.

95
00:15:31,926 --> 00:15:39,725
Osman Bey. Most of my brothers became martyrs.

96
00:15:40,286 --> 00:15:46,045
Gurdogan is no more.

97
00:15:47,726 --> 00:15:52,045
Thank Allah, Talay Alp was here.

98
00:15:52,246 --> 00:15:57,365
He fought like a soldier.
Reduced our losses little bit.

99
00:15:57,446 --> 00:16:01,685
EyvAllah. May you live long, Talay Alp.

100
00:16:01,886 --> 00:16:06,405
It is our duty, my bey. However,
we weren't enough, that is my sorrow.

101
00:16:08,126 --> 00:16:12,005
You got inside the Bannerless. And now..

102
00:16:12,086 --> 00:16:15,525
You will get beside Osman.

103
00:16:15,766 --> 00:16:20,085
We will know his every move, Talay.

104
00:16:20,366 --> 00:16:22,725
Gorklu Khan puts a lot of trust in you.

105
00:16:22,846 --> 00:16:27,085
-I will report everything.
-Come on.

106
00:16:31,086 --> 00:16:34,885
Won't we have them pay for this, my bey?

107
00:16:35,006 --> 00:16:38,045
Of course we will!

108
00:16:38,126 --> 00:16:41,605
When did we not! Do not worry!

109
00:16:41,766 --> 00:16:47,485
We will have them pay for
this a hundred times more!

110
00:16:49,406 --> 00:16:52,325
However first!

111
00:16:53,486 --> 00:16:57,805
First, we will tend to our wounds. After that..

112
00:16:57,886 --> 00:17:02,445
After that, we will be after
that Gorklu Khan always!

113
00:17:02,566 --> 00:17:05,285
-Boran!
-My bey.

114
00:17:06,806 --> 00:17:12,285
Send your most skilled scouts after Gorklu Khan.

115
00:17:12,964 --> 00:17:18,045
-You will find that dog for me.
-As you command, my bey.

116
00:17:23,366 --> 00:17:27,885
My valiants. Valiants.

117
00:17:28,846 --> 00:17:34,045
Alps..

118
00:17:35,566 --> 00:17:43,125
I swear to you. We will have your vengeance.

119
00:17:47,486 --> 00:17:52,525
I will have your vengeance.

120
00:17:54,446 --> 00:17:58,765
Fitnat, let me go. This is Yenisehir, unlike
your frontier marketplace someone can..

121
00:17:58,926 --> 00:18:03,365
Shut it, Ulgen move!

122
00:18:05,406 --> 00:18:10,285
-Fitnat what are you doing? -I said shut it.

123
00:18:25,526 --> 00:18:28,845
Saadet Hatun, what happened?

124
00:18:34,286 --> 00:18:40,645
Who are you? Who are
you to threaten my daughter?

125
00:18:41,286 --> 00:18:45,245
Do you think you are a match
for my daughter just because..

126
00:18:45,326 --> 00:18:50,005
We took you in and fed you?

127
00:18:51,206 --> 00:18:55,565
-Who are you Ulgen?
-I did what I thought was right.

128
00:18:55,646 --> 00:18:59,365
You should ask yourself instead.
What kind of mother would do such..

129
00:18:59,446 --> 00:19:02,045
I would take you
life right here.

130
00:19:02,166 --> 00:19:08,765
I would take your life
however, pray for your child.

131
00:19:10,406 --> 00:19:16,565
You can not understand me.
You need to be as strong as me..

132
00:19:16,646 --> 00:19:20,845
To understand me, Ulgen.

133
00:19:21,446 --> 00:19:26,285
Now, you will say nothing..

134
00:19:26,486 --> 00:19:31,765
To anyone, not a single person. Understood?

135
00:19:32,086 --> 00:19:36,885
I owe a lot to Alaeddin Bey and Kayis.

136
00:19:37,046 --> 00:19:40,845
I won't keep such a thing secret, Saadet Hatun.

137
00:19:43,566 --> 00:19:47,925
Did you hear that, Fitnat?

138
00:19:48,566 --> 00:19:53,365
Ulgen owes a lot to Kayis.

139
00:19:54,606 --> 00:20:00,925
Then, snitch on Cerkutay before Gonca.

140
00:20:01,406 --> 00:20:06,165
-What did Cerkutay do?
-What did he do?

141
00:20:06,486 --> 00:20:09,325
You don't know.

142
00:20:11,286 --> 00:20:16,925
Cerkutay is a spy of Yakup Bey.

143
00:20:17,246 --> 00:20:22,165
He reports everything that Osman Bey does.

144
00:20:23,886 --> 00:20:27,045
No he does not.

145
00:20:27,126 --> 00:20:30,605
My Cerkutay wouldn't do such a thing.

146
00:20:31,046 --> 00:20:36,365
If you do not believe me, ask your husband.

147
00:20:40,246 --> 00:20:46,885
Look, if you tell them a single thing..

148
00:20:47,206 --> 00:20:52,325
I will tell them the real spy is Cerkutay..

149
00:20:52,406 --> 00:20:56,965
And have Osman Bey behead Cerkutay.

150
00:20:57,206 --> 00:21:02,045
Now go, and ask your husband.

151
00:21:19,526 --> 00:21:25,005
Now, we silenced Ulgen.

152
00:21:25,126 --> 00:21:28,565
We gave Alaeddin the response he wanted.

153
00:21:28,646 --> 00:21:33,565
He will know me as the reason
why Gonca stays away from him.

154
00:21:33,846 --> 00:21:39,005
And just like that, our
play will not get exposed.

155
00:21:39,206 --> 00:21:42,845
How will you convince Gonca Hatun?

156
00:21:43,006 --> 00:21:45,445
She nearly told Alaeddin Bey everything.

157
00:21:45,606 --> 00:21:52,125
Fitnat. Every person has weaknesses.

158
00:21:53,006 --> 00:21:58,885
We have a lot to do. Come
on, we will see Bala now.

159
00:22:04,286 --> 00:22:07,565
Konur. Inform the beys of Kayi.

160
00:22:07,686 --> 00:22:11,845
Now, we form the army of Kayi.
I want everyone who can hold a sword!

161
00:22:11,966 --> 00:22:15,205
-As you command, my bey.
-They will be trained..

162
00:22:15,206 --> 00:22:18,205
Until their eyes can not see
and their legs can not hold!

163
00:22:18,206 --> 00:22:20,325
We will form the skilled army of Kayi, my bey.

164
00:22:20,406 --> 00:22:22,885
All of the scouts are after Gorklu Khan, my bey.

165
00:22:22,886 --> 00:22:27,645
As you commanded, they won't leave any
rocks unturned and any tracks unsearched.

166
00:22:27,846 --> 00:22:32,045
Having the princess with
us will damage his reputation.

167
00:22:32,246 --> 00:22:35,125
He'll attempt to attack
us before Ilkhanids hear.

168
00:22:35,326 --> 00:22:42,005
But we will jump on him so we
won't experience this suffering again.

169
00:22:44,726 --> 00:22:48,485
-Horses to go to Yenisehir are ready, my Bey.
-No.

170
00:22:48,686 --> 00:22:50,445
We aren't going to Yenisehir.

171
00:22:50,486 --> 00:22:57,125
He'll attack like a wounded dog.
We won't stop as long as he lives.

172
00:22:57,126 --> 00:23:01,125
We'll build a huge headquarter.
Beys and alps will be with us.

173
00:23:01,406 --> 00:23:08,525
Tell Beys to keep their lands
safe and then come join us.

174
00:23:11,806 --> 00:23:14,085
-Amir Gorklu Khan.
-Yes?

175
00:23:14,206 --> 00:23:16,925
I'll demand horsemen from Konya.

176
00:23:17,206 --> 00:23:20,085
No.

177
00:23:20,406 --> 00:23:25,565
We won't let anyone hear this
issue. We have enough nokers.

178
00:23:25,766 --> 00:23:30,405
Just show me a target, commander.

179
00:23:30,566 --> 00:23:33,365
We've sent nokers all around.

180
00:23:33,486 --> 00:23:37,205
We'll check every place
where the princess may be.

181
00:23:37,606 --> 00:23:42,525
We have a spy beside Osman. We're
waiting for him to send a message.

182
00:23:42,606 --> 00:23:46,765
We won't wait but strike.

183
00:23:46,846 --> 00:23:52,605
Until we find the princess,
we will burn everywhere down.

184
00:23:52,766 --> 00:23:56,965
There will be nowhere still standing!

185
00:23:58,726 --> 00:24:01,085
And then?

186
00:24:01,166 --> 00:24:06,965
They took my wife-to-be, commander.

187
00:24:07,406 --> 00:24:10,765
After I take Maria...

188
00:24:11,006 --> 00:24:13,925
..an army of nokers will come here.

189
00:24:14,126 --> 00:24:18,325
Byzantine army and they will join together.

190
00:24:18,486 --> 00:24:23,245
I will build a tower with..

191
00:24:23,446 --> 00:24:27,205
...the heads of impertinent Turks.

192
00:24:27,446 --> 00:24:35,285
I will sit on it and watch the world!

193
00:24:38,846 --> 00:24:42,965
But the princess first.

194
00:24:43,126 --> 00:24:46,325
Their destination will be the graveyard.

195
00:24:47,606 --> 00:24:52,445
You will have another duty, commander.

196
00:24:54,366 --> 00:24:56,445
Come closer.

197
00:25:12,846 --> 00:25:16,525
We should go to Osman Bey.

198
00:25:17,886 --> 00:25:23,725
Osman's alps are chasing us.

199
00:25:24,566 --> 00:25:27,245
He will come after me.

200
00:25:27,406 --> 00:25:32,725
You will shoot Osman.

201
00:25:34,246 --> 00:25:38,645
I will take the princess.

202
00:25:41,006 --> 00:25:45,005
You won't come to Yenisehir again, Gonca.

203
00:25:45,126 --> 00:25:48,605
-Mother...
-Gonca!

204
00:25:50,126 --> 00:25:54,445
We have much to do in the frontier market.

205
00:25:54,806 --> 00:25:58,125
Alps!

206
00:26:00,726 --> 00:26:06,365
Accompany Gonca Hatun to the frontier market.

207
00:26:07,446 --> 00:26:10,365
Come on.

208
00:26:20,326 --> 00:26:26,085
Saadet Hatun, what do you think you are doing?

209
00:26:26,166 --> 00:26:30,125
You shouldn't provoke people at such times.

210
00:26:30,126 --> 00:26:35,485
Provoking people? Who is doing that?

211
00:26:35,966 --> 00:26:39,925
I'm just telling the truth.

212
00:26:40,286 --> 00:26:44,125
Every move you make is torture to Turks.

213
00:26:44,206 --> 00:26:47,805
Know your place, Saadet.... Hatun.

214
00:26:48,926 --> 00:26:51,805
We torture nobody.

215
00:26:51,886 --> 00:26:55,285
We always work for the welfare of Turks.

216
00:26:55,446 --> 00:26:58,405
Don't confuse us with yourself.

217
00:26:58,526 --> 00:27:03,605
Welfare of Turks, huh? Welfare of Turks?

218
00:27:03,846 --> 00:27:08,845
Didn't you make Mongolians
mess with us for gold?

219
00:27:09,006 --> 00:27:12,885
Didn't the frontier market
get attacked because of you?

220
00:27:13,046 --> 00:27:19,845
Keep yelling! Yell even more. But
you won't be able to reach your purpose.

221
00:27:20,166 --> 00:27:23,165
We will see. Tomorrow.

222
00:27:23,246 --> 00:27:26,765
You'll see when there are
no stalls left in the market.

223
00:27:26,846 --> 00:27:29,525
Nobody trusts you anymore.

224
00:27:29,566 --> 00:27:33,285
Go, Saadet Hatun. Go.

225
00:27:36,726 --> 00:27:39,645
You heard Yakup Bey!

226
00:27:39,846 --> 00:27:42,725
The frontier market will be always open...

227
00:27:42,846 --> 00:27:46,645
...to those who want to
protect their lives and goods.

228
00:27:48,326 --> 00:27:52,805
Oh... Bala.

229
00:27:53,406 --> 00:27:58,725
Tell your son Alaaddin to
stay away from my daughter.

230
00:27:58,926 --> 00:28:03,885
If I see him with her again
I will make him pay for it.

231
00:28:04,126 --> 00:28:09,005
Saadet! You have no power..

232
00:28:09,046 --> 00:28:12,685
...to make my son pay.

233
00:28:12,766 --> 00:28:17,685
If you attempt to touch my
son, I will cut your hand off.

234
00:28:18,246 --> 00:28:19,685
We will see.

235
00:28:56,086 --> 00:29:00,005
Praise be!

236
00:29:02,446 --> 00:29:05,485
Praise be!

237
00:29:07,046 --> 00:29:09,725
There...

238
00:29:10,486 --> 00:29:13,845
This is the spirit to make us a state...

239
00:29:13,966 --> 00:29:17,445
...and make us prevail forever!

240
00:29:24,686 --> 00:29:29,965
-Thank my Creator.
-Thank Allah.

241
00:29:31,206 --> 00:29:36,725
Why did you choose this place as the
headquarter, my Bey? It's away from our borders.

242
00:29:36,926 --> 00:29:41,645
Son, this place...

243
00:29:42,126 --> 00:29:48,165
...is in the right middle of our
tribes around and our other lands.

244
00:29:48,526 --> 00:29:54,765
It's only away from Kestel.
Orhan will protect it, though.

245
00:29:55,646 --> 00:29:58,525
Isn't our priority being close
to Gorklu Khan, my Bey?

246
00:29:58,606 --> 00:30:03,885
No. If he attacks us before we find Gorklu Khan,

247
00:30:04,086 --> 00:30:08,045
...which will never happen,
we will never let that happen.

248
00:30:08,246 --> 00:30:12,525
We need to find him and attack.

249
00:30:14,806 --> 00:30:16,525
-Boran.
-My Bey.

250
00:30:16,566 --> 00:30:21,285
-Any news from the scouts?
-Not yet, my Bey.

251
00:30:29,326 --> 00:30:33,085
My Bey.

252
00:30:39,406 --> 00:30:44,645
This is from Yenisehir, my Bey.
Yakup Bey invites all the merchants...

253
00:30:44,646 --> 00:30:48,245
...to the frontier market.

254
00:30:53,806 --> 00:30:57,565
Because of the attack in Sogut?

255
00:31:03,526 --> 00:31:07,885
Ya Allah... Ya Allah...

256
00:31:09,526 --> 00:31:15,365
My Allah... Now...

257
00:31:15,486 --> 00:31:21,085
If I don't stop now, they'll
call me a brother slayer.

258
00:31:21,286 --> 00:31:26,525
If I stop, my heart won't let me stop.

259
00:31:26,646 --> 00:31:29,645
Yakup Bey...

260
00:31:31,326 --> 00:31:39,005
He's trying to use every
opportunity to attack me. Yakup Bey...

261
00:31:40,926 --> 00:31:44,285
But I won't let him.

262
00:31:44,726 --> 00:31:47,285
-Alaaddin.
-My Bey.

263
00:31:47,486 --> 00:31:52,725
Go to the frontier market.
Keep your eyes on Yakup Bey.

264
00:31:52,926 --> 00:31:57,925
-As you order, my Bey.
-Konur.

265
00:31:58,846 --> 00:32:02,645
Place the watchmen on the hills.

266
00:32:02,766 --> 00:32:08,005
-First, we'll keep the headquarter safe.
-As you order, my Bey.

267
00:32:08,006 --> 00:32:09,765
-Boran.
-My Bey.

268
00:32:09,766 --> 00:32:12,965
Choose the best veterans.

269
00:32:13,126 --> 00:32:17,765
Tell them to train our men.
-As my Bey orders.

270
00:32:18,686 --> 00:32:22,605
My Bey, we've located Gorklu Khan.

271
00:32:32,246 --> 00:32:35,365
Let's go.

272
00:32:42,006 --> 00:32:47,845
You can only know Gorklu Khan if he
wants you to know. Now go towards the trap.

273
00:33:21,406 --> 00:33:25,485
We need to leave before
Orhan comes to take me, Andra.

274
00:33:25,646 --> 00:33:27,605
Come on.

275
00:33:32,086 --> 00:33:36,125
Help me!

276
00:33:41,806 --> 00:33:45,245
What's going on? What is burning?

277
00:33:45,486 --> 00:33:50,285
-What's this smell?
-It's so bad.

278
00:34:20,686 --> 00:34:24,085
This is the door for the secret passage.

279
00:34:36,485 --> 00:34:39,485
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER BAZAAR

280
00:34:39,766 --> 00:34:44,165
The cities he ruled are

281
00:34:44,406 --> 00:34:48,525
paying the price for Osman's insolence.

282
00:34:49,806 --> 00:34:56,405
Let those who supported
him see Osman's helplessness.

283
00:34:56,686 --> 00:35:01,045
It seems like Sogut will not
be enough for them, Yakup Bey.

284
00:35:01,366 --> 00:35:04,565
They will...

285
00:35:04,646 --> 00:35:08,485
...keep attacking Osman
until they find the Princess.

286
00:35:10,726 --> 00:35:14,325
If you kidnap Mongols' bride...

287
00:35:14,486 --> 00:35:18,725
-...this is what happens.
-This princess...

288
00:35:19,606 --> 00:35:24,285
What are we going to do,
father? Will we go after her?

289
00:35:24,566 --> 00:35:27,823
-Are we going to wait
and watch both sides?

290
00:35:27,835 --> 00:35:28,925
Since when...

291
00:35:29,886 --> 00:35:34,045
...does a sultan sit and wait?

292
00:35:36,566 --> 00:35:40,685
We will capture the Princess.

293
00:35:41,486 --> 00:35:46,765
I will turn everything upside down.

294
00:35:46,886 --> 00:35:50,125
Then let me get the alps
ready and let's go after them.

295
00:35:50,206 --> 00:35:52,605
No.

296
00:35:53,126 --> 00:35:56,365
You don't need to bother.

297
00:35:57,486 --> 00:36:02,165
We'll cut to the chase.

298
00:36:03,766 --> 00:36:08,525
-May I come in, my Sultan?
-Come in.

299
00:36:16,806 --> 00:36:21,085
You have called me, Sultan Yakup.

300
00:36:21,206 --> 00:36:26,685
I have called you, Cerkutay, I have.

301
00:36:27,566 --> 00:36:33,565
What about you? Have you done
everything I ordered you to do?

302
00:36:39,326 --> 00:36:44,525
-I did my best..
-Shut up!

303
00:36:57,166 --> 00:37:01,205
You can go and track it down if you want.

304
00:37:01,526 --> 00:37:07,405
Or you can find it out from Osman's palace.

305
00:37:08,086 --> 00:37:12,925
Find me the Princess.

306
00:37:14,686 --> 00:37:18,525
Your wish is my command, my Sultan.
-If...

307
00:37:18,606 --> 00:37:23,565
...if you come back empty-handed again, Cerkutay

308
00:37:23,646 --> 00:37:27,445
I'll burn you.

309
00:37:27,526 --> 00:37:34,925
If I burn you, first your loved
ones will be the first to catch fire.

310
00:37:36,486 --> 00:37:43,725
Keep it in mind. Now go away!

311
00:37:50,686 --> 00:37:53,845
Come on!

312
00:38:14,046 --> 00:38:18,285
-My Shahzade!
-I hope nothing is wrong.

313
00:38:19,206 --> 00:38:24,605
-What's going on, Oguz Alp? What happened?
-My Shahzade.

314
00:38:24,886 --> 00:38:29,085
Holofira Hatun tricked the alps and escaped.

315
00:38:29,206 --> 00:38:32,565
What are you saying, Oguz?

316
00:38:32,966 --> 00:38:37,205
How could all those alps not stop
this? Why did I leave you there?

317
00:38:37,366 --> 00:38:40,519
Alps are after her, they
are checking all the places

318
00:38:40,531 --> 00:38:43,285
leading to Atranos. She
left these in her room.

319
00:38:52,486 --> 00:38:55,805
Holofira.

320
00:39:00,046 --> 00:39:03,823
Every flower lives where
it belongs, Orhan. I know

321
00:39:03,835 --> 00:39:07,405
you won't give up, but
don't push it any further.

322
00:39:07,646 --> 00:39:15,205
Don't come after me.
This is better for all of us.

323
00:39:16,406 --> 00:39:21,845
You're right, Holofira. I will not give up.

324
00:39:24,246 --> 00:39:28,805
I'll find you and I'll bring
you back, I'll not give up!

325
00:39:29,166 --> 00:39:33,845
Inform the alps, tell them to set traps
everywhere from Kestel to the valley.

326
00:39:34,046 --> 00:39:36,792
The Frontiers are filled
with enemies, not a single

327
00:39:36,804 --> 00:39:39,405
Crusader will cross to our
homeland from the west.

328
00:39:39,606 --> 00:39:43,005
-Yes, my Shahzade.
-Kara Ali.

329
00:39:43,086 --> 00:39:45,925
-My Shahzade.
-We will find Holofira before dark.

330
00:39:46,086 --> 00:39:48,725
-Come on!
-Yes, my Shahzade.

331
00:39:51,886 --> 00:39:55,245
Come on!

332
00:40:17,206 --> 00:40:22,725
Osman set out to hunt,
soon he will be the prey.

333
00:40:22,846 --> 00:40:28,245
Osman and his followers
will lose their heads!

334
00:40:35,206 --> 00:40:42,005
He will give the princess first,
and then he will give his head.

335
00:40:50,446 --> 00:40:54,845
Commander, Osman is approaching.

336
00:40:58,406 --> 00:41:02,845
Let the wind give wings to his
horse so that he may come quickly.

337
00:41:02,926 --> 00:41:07,045
There are matters to be
settled and blood to be spilled.

338
00:41:07,166 --> 00:41:11,165
avenge my brother!

339
00:41:11,286 --> 00:41:15,765
Nokers, hide.

340
00:41:16,046 --> 00:41:18,845
Come on.

341
00:41:41,446 --> 00:41:47,125
Alps, defend!
Protect the people!

342
00:41:55,846 --> 00:41:59,925
Kill them all.

343
00:42:00,006 --> 00:42:03,925
I'll destroy all the tribes of Osman

344
00:42:04,126 --> 00:42:09,805
...and I'll destroy all of his cities
under the hooves of my horses!

345
00:42:41,366 --> 00:42:44,885
Until we take the Princess...

346
00:42:45,006 --> 00:42:50,085
...peace will be replaced
with blood in these lands.

347
00:42:50,286 --> 00:42:53,965
Attack!

348
00:42:58,246 --> 00:43:02,045
Alps!

349
00:43:15,846 --> 00:43:19,925
Shield formation!

350
00:43:24,646 --> 00:43:28,525
Osman.

351
00:43:31,766 --> 00:43:36,165
Surrender and give us the Princess, so
that your armies and lands can survive.

352
00:43:36,286 --> 00:43:41,805
This land will not be saved by
surrendering but by resisting oppression.

353
00:43:45,846 --> 00:43:47,365
-Boran.
-My Bey.

354
00:43:47,446 --> 00:43:49,925
-Kill the archers.
-Yes, my Bey.

355
00:43:50,006 --> 00:43:53,005
Samil, come, brother.

356
00:44:13,326 --> 00:44:17,085
The Righteous!

357
00:44:17,286 --> 00:44:21,045
These dastards will see the power of Turks.

358
00:44:26,646 --> 00:44:30,765
My glorious armies will conquer your lands.

359
00:44:30,846 --> 00:44:36,285
These lands, conquered after much sufferings,
are the gateway of the Turks to the beyond.

360
00:44:36,566 --> 00:44:40,965
Our adhan will not be silenced
and our banner will not come down.

361
00:44:55,646 --> 00:44:58,805
Father!

362
00:45:00,366 --> 00:45:05,085
Father!

363
00:45:08,046 --> 00:45:12,725
Come, girl, let your father go.

364
00:45:13,726 --> 00:45:19,245
-Come here.
-Father! Father!

365
00:45:24,406 --> 00:45:27,485
My brave boys, attack! Kill these murderers!

366
00:45:27,566 --> 00:45:30,565
My power has gone beyond the borders

367
00:45:30,646 --> 00:45:34,885
no one was able to stop,
are you going to stop me?

368
00:45:39,446 --> 00:45:44,125
I'll stop you, and if I can't, those
who come after me will stop you!

369
00:45:45,086 --> 00:45:49,965
I'll rip the courage out of
your heart with my own hands.

370
00:46:02,726 --> 00:46:06,045
You and your father will be destroyed.

371
00:46:06,126 --> 00:46:09,925
Everyone who stands against me will be ruined.

372
00:46:10,446 --> 00:46:15,405
-Where is the princess?
-This fire will burn you too, Mongol.

373
00:46:15,606 --> 00:46:20,045
Osman Bey will...

374
00:46:20,366 --> 00:46:22,765
What is your order, Emir Gorklu Khan?

375
00:46:22,846 --> 00:46:28,405
He is not in Sogut, he is
not in the tribes, from here

376
00:46:28,526 --> 00:46:32,165
to Bursa, burn down all the tribes

377
00:46:32,246 --> 00:46:36,565
all the inns and all the tents!

378
00:46:47,686 --> 00:46:50,525
Sogut incurred the wrath of the Mongols.

379
00:46:50,686 --> 00:46:53,285
Now you too will incur my wrath.

380
00:46:53,366 --> 00:46:55,925
You will kneel before me!

381
00:46:56,006 --> 00:47:00,245
You will pay for what you did to Sogut!

382
00:47:03,846 --> 00:47:08,165
My nokers! Cut their heads off!

383
00:47:08,326 --> 00:47:10,645
Cover!

384
00:48:22,286 --> 00:48:25,685
-You will give me the Princess, Osman.
-The only thing you will take...

385
00:48:25,806 --> 00:48:29,765
...will be the sharp side of my sword!

386
00:48:32,206 --> 00:48:35,285
Your bravery won't save you from death!

387
00:48:35,406 --> 00:48:39,405
You won't die easily... you
shameless Karacelasun!

388
00:48:45,366 --> 00:48:49,965
You did not surrender! Now
you will lose the things you had!

389
00:49:03,846 --> 00:49:07,805
Osman... It is customary to get even.

390
00:49:07,926 --> 00:49:11,765
Now we are stepping back, my
nokers. We will come back stronger.

391
00:49:11,846 --> 00:49:14,245
We will come back with a stronger revenge.

392
00:49:14,246 --> 00:49:19,085
Come! Come here!

393
00:49:21,406 --> 00:49:28,245
You are running again... You are running
again... You shameless Karacelasun...

394
00:49:32,526 --> 00:49:34,285
Alps!

395
00:49:34,606 --> 00:49:39,485
That Karacelasun dog is around. But
Gorklu Khan is no where to be found.

396
00:49:39,606 --> 00:49:42,005
Apparently, he is attacking somewhere.

397
00:49:42,086 --> 00:49:46,805
You will go everywhere! You will
find that dog and bring him to me!

398
00:49:46,926 --> 00:49:49,165
Go now!

399
00:49:54,126 --> 00:49:58,965
And we are going to the
headquarters. No one will sleep tonight.

400
00:49:59,046 --> 00:50:02,925
We have a lot to do. Bring the horses!

401
00:50:17,366 --> 00:50:20,965
Our people are packing the
things on their counters, mother.

402
00:50:20,966 --> 00:50:24,325
Look at what they did... Are they all leaving?

403
00:50:24,486 --> 00:50:29,445
Right... They are all leaving
except for five or six of them, mother.

404
00:50:30,646 --> 00:50:33,965
Then we have no other choice.

405
00:50:34,246 --> 00:50:40,085
Ulgen, Kismet. Send news to Alps.
All doors of Yenisehir will be closed.

406
00:50:40,166 --> 00:50:43,845
Gather all our shopkeepers here.

407
00:50:47,166 --> 00:50:49,845
What are you going to do, mother?

408
00:50:50,846 --> 00:50:53,085
You will see, my daughter.

409
00:50:56,046 --> 00:50:59,045
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER BAZAAR

410
00:51:06,966 --> 00:51:11,245
-Stop... Stop.
-Alaeddin...

411
00:51:11,886 --> 00:51:13,981
What were you looking for?

412
00:51:13,993 --> 00:51:16,725
I found what I
was looking for...

413
00:51:16,806 --> 00:51:21,725
Drop that down first. You
were going to slit my throat.

414
00:51:22,686 --> 00:51:26,525
You would have been dead if I hadn't noticed.

415
00:51:27,886 --> 00:51:30,885
-So you would kill me..
-I guess..

416
00:51:30,966 --> 00:51:33,965
You are a merciless Hatun then.

417
00:51:37,846 --> 00:51:43,125
-Alaeddin, what are you doing here?
-I'm on duty.

418
00:51:46,566 --> 00:51:51,205
Are you alright? Your mother
did not do anything to you, right?

419
00:51:55,086 --> 00:51:58,325
-Is it your duty to spy on us?
-Gonca...

420
00:51:58,606 --> 00:52:02,085
Are you not giving me that
answer because of your mother?

421
00:52:03,166 --> 00:52:06,483
Alaeddin... Don't you
see the situation we are in?

422
00:52:06,495 --> 00:52:07,605
I do.

423
00:52:09,926 --> 00:52:14,005
I do, but... It does not seem impossible to me.

424
00:52:15,406 --> 00:52:20,965
What were the answers you couldn't give?
You couldn't speak when your mother came.

425
00:52:27,886 --> 00:52:33,165
Now go. Look, we will be in
trouble if someone sees us. Please.

426
00:52:33,246 --> 00:52:38,965
I will go now. But I am going
because I don't want you to get hurt.

427
00:52:58,206 --> 00:53:03,445
Barbarians! Open the door! Open the door!

428
00:53:03,646 --> 00:53:08,725
Barbarians! You will pay for this!

429
00:53:18,126 --> 00:53:21,083
Princess must get ready
as soon as possible. We

430
00:53:21,095 --> 00:53:24,125
will take her to the place
we prepared in advance.

431
00:53:25,126 --> 00:53:28,045
They found me, right?

432
00:53:29,766 --> 00:53:32,325
No...

433
00:53:34,486 --> 00:53:39,285
It's worse. They attacked.

434
00:53:39,606 --> 00:53:45,805
Barbarians... If you don't let
me go, worse things will happen.

435
00:53:46,646 --> 00:53:50,045
Allah is sufficient for us.

436
00:53:50,126 --> 00:53:54,525
Are we the ones who are barbarians, Princess?

437
00:53:55,566 --> 00:54:00,885
Barbarians are in Byzantium.
Barbarians are Mongols.

438
00:54:02,166 --> 00:54:07,405
Whoever rules with evil is barbarian.

439
00:54:08,926 --> 00:54:13,805
Thanks to us, order has come to these lands.

440
00:54:13,966 --> 00:54:20,245
Islam and justice have come.
And with Allah's consent...

441
00:54:20,446 --> 00:54:23,645
...they will live here forever.

442
00:54:24,646 --> 00:54:30,885
One day you will wake up from
this sleep. You only brought evil.

443
00:54:32,326 --> 00:54:35,045
We are ready to set out, Bayindir Bey.

444
00:54:35,246 --> 00:54:39,045
You cannot abduct me. They
will find me sooner or later.

445
00:54:39,126 --> 00:54:41,125
Princess.

446
00:54:41,806 --> 00:54:47,085
If they plan games, we can plan games.

447
00:54:48,166 --> 00:54:54,765
They won't be able to take you from us and
they won't be able to organize that wedding.

448
00:54:54,846 --> 00:54:58,525
Come on! Get ready! We are leaving!

449
00:55:06,846 --> 00:55:09,805
My Allah... My Allah...

450
00:55:09,886 --> 00:55:13,205
Enemies are always setting traps on our path.

451
00:55:13,406 --> 00:55:18,365
They are always trying to
stop us. But we know that...

452
00:55:18,686 --> 00:55:22,805
You are the Best Planner.

453
00:55:23,006 --> 00:55:28,125
May You grant us with victory, my Allah.

454
00:55:43,566 --> 00:55:50,245
As the branches of the plane tree rise to
the sky, its pain grows, huh, Osman Bey?

455
00:55:51,166 --> 00:55:54,685
Ah, ah Dervish Efendi.

456
00:55:54,886 --> 00:55:58,445
If the plane tree spread all over the world..

457
00:55:58,566 --> 00:56:01,445
...we would not complain about its pain.

458
00:56:02,446 --> 00:56:07,245
-Here, Dervish Efendi. Here. Welcome.
-Thank you.

459
00:56:07,566 --> 00:56:12,485
We wanted to come and see you when we
heard that you were a sovereign Beylic now.

460
00:56:12,646 --> 00:56:17,685
-May it be blessed for all our communiy.
-Thank you, thank you

461
00:56:20,566 --> 00:56:24,365
Enemies are always trying to stop us.

462
00:56:24,646 --> 00:56:31,565
But... there are also people who
get happy about our sovereign Beylic.

463
00:56:31,646 --> 00:56:37,285
Your way is the way of
The Messenger of Allah (PBUH). As you know...

464
00:56:37,366 --> 00:56:42,085
All the wealthy and powerful men of Mecca...

465
00:56:42,166 --> 00:56:47,205
...committed various evil acts to
make the Messenger of Allah give up.

466
00:56:47,366 --> 00:56:51,325
They tried to convince both him
and those who believed in him...

467
00:56:51,486 --> 00:56:56,045
...to leave their path with oppression.

468
00:56:56,406 --> 00:57:01,285
But he did not give up and continued to Tabligh.
(Conveying the message of Islam)

469
00:57:02,286 --> 00:57:08,365
The polytheists of Mecca offered an agreement
to the Prophet (PBUH) as a last resort.

470
00:57:08,606 --> 00:57:12,605
"Let the property be yours
as much as you wish, we will...

471
00:57:12,846 --> 00:57:17,805
...make you the richest and most respected
man in Mecca. Just give up on your path...

472
00:57:17,926 --> 00:57:21,885
...give up on your cause,
do not disturb our order."

473
00:57:24,446 --> 00:57:30,205
The Messenger of Allah said: "My
Allah sent me to you as a Prophet.

474
00:57:30,286 --> 00:57:34,085
He revealed the book to me. If you believe...

475
00:57:34,286 --> 00:57:39,885
...you will be happy both in
this world and in the hereafter.

476
00:57:40,126 --> 00:57:42,845
If you deny it...

477
00:57:42,966 --> 00:57:49,045
...I will wait patiently
until the Judgement Day.

478
00:57:49,566 --> 00:57:55,045
Stop worshiping idols, worship only Allah.

479
00:57:55,246 --> 00:57:58,165
Otherwise, even if you give
me the moon in one hand...

480
00:57:58,246 --> 00:58:02,685
...and the sun in the other hand
I will not give up on my cause.

481
00:58:02,686 --> 00:58:03,845
...and the sun in the other hand,
I will not give up on my cuase."

482
00:58:04,286 --> 00:58:09,845
Now, your path is the path
of the Messenger of Allah.

483
00:58:09,966 --> 00:58:14,725
They will throw thorns at
your feet rather than roses.

484
00:58:14,806 --> 00:58:18,525
But you will walk.

485
00:58:19,566 --> 00:58:22,365
Right. Right.

486
00:58:23,006 --> 00:58:28,085
Our intention is to be
honest and be a good Muslim.

487
00:58:28,686 --> 00:58:35,285
Our cause is the Messenger of Allah's cause.
But... But I know...

488
00:58:35,486 --> 00:58:40,725
...that there were always
people around our the Messenger of Allah

489
00:58:42,046 --> 00:58:49,205
Right... There were Siddiqs who were
ready to sacrifice themselves for him.

490
00:58:49,686 --> 00:58:54,245
O, Dervish Efendi... We have
been talking to you for a long time.

491
00:58:54,326 --> 00:58:58,725
We met through an ant nest and now we are here.

492
00:58:58,846 --> 00:59:02,485
Your words are our light, thank you.

493
00:59:03,326 --> 00:59:07,205
What if... I asked you to tell me your name...

494
00:59:07,286 --> 00:59:11,085
-Would I be going beyond my limit?
-Not at all.

495
00:59:11,166 --> 00:59:16,565
Why would you go beyond the
limit? We are Tapduk's Yunus.

496
00:59:17,646 --> 00:59:21,245
-We are just a poor Dervish.
-Yunus?

497
00:59:23,206 --> 00:59:28,525
Yunus Emre? Are you Yunus Emre?

498
00:59:33,886 --> 00:59:36,965
Oh praise be!

499
00:59:38,206 --> 00:59:42,445
Come, please.

500
00:59:44,886 --> 00:59:48,525
Yunus Emre, huh? Yunus Emre...

501
00:59:51,166 --> 00:59:57,565
Praise be... We have been hearing
your words and poems for a long time!

502
00:59:57,646 --> 01:00:05,645
But you were here! Right next to us...
Oh praise be!

503
01:00:06,446 --> 01:00:11,565
Now you heard our sovereign Beylic, huh?

504
01:00:12,366 --> 01:00:18,965
Then... if you allow me, we
want to see you more often.

505
01:00:19,926 --> 01:00:24,245
As my Allah allows, our roads will unite.

506
01:00:24,406 --> 01:00:29,205
We are always next to people
who are walking on the way of The Righteous

507
01:00:32,986 --> 01:00:34,717
Now allow us please..

508
01:00:34,729 --> 01:00:37,525
Sure, sure.

509
01:00:37,686 --> 01:00:42,605
You can leave. You can leave.

510
01:00:51,686 --> 01:00:56,725
Yunus Emre. Yunus Emre.

511
01:01:25,286 --> 01:01:30,925
They are on foot, must be
close. You will search everywhere.

512
01:01:31,006 --> 01:01:33,285
Everyone will stay on alert! Come on!

513
01:01:33,366 --> 01:01:36,925
-As you command, my shahzade.
-As you command, my shahzade.

514
01:01:38,566 --> 01:01:42,365
You are in this area, daughter of the lord.

515
01:01:43,366 --> 01:01:46,885
You are very close.

516
01:01:58,846 --> 01:02:06,405
Orhan, I know you will be very
angry but this is for your own good.

517
01:02:07,286 --> 01:02:11,165
My lady, we have a long way to Atranos.

518
01:02:11,246 --> 01:02:15,245
I think we have to spend the night
here should we look for places to camp?

519
01:02:15,326 --> 01:02:21,885
We can not stop no matter what
Andra. Orhan must be on our tail by now.

520
01:03:02,886 --> 01:03:06,925
Are you going to strike?

521
01:03:07,526 --> 01:03:09,885
Strike then, daughter of the lord.

522
01:03:10,046 --> 01:03:15,045
-How did you find us?
-I was worried sick Holofira.

523
01:03:15,886 --> 01:03:19,725
What if something happened to you?

524
01:03:20,206 --> 01:03:23,845
When there are nokers and robbers
all around, how can you get away?

525
01:03:23,926 --> 01:03:28,605
You didn't leave me no other choice.
-I didn't leave you any choice?

526
01:03:30,486 --> 01:03:34,685
And this is the solution you came up with?

527
01:03:35,886 --> 01:03:39,565
-Baciyan Holofira.
-You came here for nothing, Orhan.

528
01:03:41,086 --> 01:03:45,245
I won't come back. I am going to Atranos.

529
01:03:45,606 --> 01:03:49,165
My Allah grant me patience.

530
01:03:50,766 --> 01:03:55,645
No. You will come back.

531
01:03:56,766 --> 01:04:01,925
You eyes tell me, you love me.

532
01:04:03,286 --> 01:04:09,965
Now, your home is Kestel.
I won't ever let you go.

533
01:04:11,326 --> 01:04:14,605
Alps! Come on, to Kestel.

534
01:04:14,726 --> 01:04:17,125
As you command, my shahzade.

535
01:04:18,046 --> 01:04:21,525
Orhan, it will be a disaster I tell you.

536
01:04:21,806 --> 01:04:24,885
You refuse to hear me. My aunt will start a war.

537
01:04:24,966 --> 01:04:27,565
Your aunt will start a war?

538
01:04:27,806 --> 01:04:31,125
Alright. Let her start.

539
01:04:32,006 --> 01:04:36,445
One thing I know for sure Holofira..

540
01:04:36,566 --> 01:04:41,925
Is that the winner of that war will be our love.

541
01:04:44,566 --> 01:04:48,725
Come on.

542
01:05:30,846 --> 01:05:34,405
We do not keep anyone by force.

543
01:05:34,606 --> 01:05:38,965
Hear us first. After that doors will be opened.

544
01:05:39,126 --> 01:05:41,565
Anyone can go wherever they want.

545
01:05:41,686 --> 01:05:45,125
Valiant soldiers and brave sisters of Kayi.

546
01:05:45,286 --> 01:05:48,245
Now is the time of unity.

547
01:05:48,446 --> 01:05:52,965
Your life and your goods are
entrusted to us in Yenisehir Marketplace.

548
01:05:52,966 --> 01:05:56,245
Those who attacked Sogut yesterday
won't attack Yenisehir tomorrow?

549
01:05:56,246 --> 01:06:00,005
-Yakup Bey is right, we will leave!
-Yes, we will leave!

550
01:06:00,446 --> 01:06:06,165
Do you really want to leave because
of your life or because of the taxes?

551
01:06:06,326 --> 01:06:09,445
First, ask yourself that!

552
01:06:09,526 --> 01:06:14,205
We will see then. One who rushes
to the gate first is the richest one.

553
01:06:14,406 --> 01:06:20,685
How will you look at your children's
faces after you change your ways for gold?

554
01:06:22,006 --> 01:06:27,325
Salim Aga. Why won't you gather your stall?

555
01:06:27,406 --> 01:06:32,285
Didn't you hear? Yakup Bey is not taxing anyone.

556
01:06:40,926 --> 01:06:44,125
Malhun Hatun.

557
01:06:45,406 --> 01:06:48,605
I owe my life to Osman Bey.

558
01:06:48,686 --> 01:06:52,565
We made a promised on this path.

559
01:06:52,726 --> 01:06:57,125
We won't leave our path, for sure.

560
01:06:57,246 --> 01:07:02,925
EyvAllah Salim Aga. May you live long.

561
01:07:04,966 --> 01:07:11,485
What about you? Those who have sacks of gold?

562
01:07:11,566 --> 01:07:15,045
Don't you owe fidelity to Osman
Bey and to the late Ertugrul Ghazi?

563
01:07:15,286 --> 01:07:18,098
-Why are you leaving up front?

564
01:07:18,110 --> 01:07:20,205
We said what we said.

565
01:07:20,366 --> 01:07:22,405
Our friends stay..

566
01:07:23,326 --> 01:07:29,085
And the door is open for our
enemies. Alps, open the door!

567
01:07:43,286 --> 01:07:46,285
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER BAZAAR

568
01:07:46,846 --> 01:07:52,805
Hatun. Any news from Holofira's aunt?

569
01:07:57,286 --> 01:08:01,285
No. Today Holofira was not
at the marketplace as well.

570
01:08:01,366 --> 01:08:04,405
It needs to be checked and not be left behind.

571
01:08:04,526 --> 01:08:06,405
You're right.

572
01:08:08,326 --> 01:08:11,445
Maiden's house is the house of the coy.

573
01:08:11,686 --> 01:08:15,805
Mehmed. You go and check tomorrow.

574
01:08:15,886 --> 01:08:19,484
Check and hear why Holofira didn't come.

575
01:08:19,685 --> 01:08:23,285
Do not worry, father. I'll check.

576
01:08:24,206 --> 01:08:27,645
After we wed Holofira and Mehmed..

577
01:08:27,725 --> 01:08:31,085
It will be Gonca's turn.

578
01:08:32,406 --> 01:08:35,604
There is still time, mother.

579
01:08:36,446 --> 01:08:40,325
What is it, hatun?

580
01:08:40,446 --> 01:08:43,285
Is there an aspirant for my Gonca?

581
01:08:43,406 --> 01:08:48,165
There is someone who can
not look away from Gonca.

582
01:08:49,326 --> 01:08:52,125
Who is it, mother?

583
01:08:57,046 --> 01:08:59,325
Alaeddin Bey.

584
01:09:05,046 --> 01:09:09,085
Alaeddin Bey the son of Osman?

585
01:09:15,046 --> 01:09:18,005
What are you saying mother?

586
01:09:18,446 --> 01:09:21,805
Gonca, is this true? Answer me!

587
01:09:24,606 --> 01:09:28,165
Brother, calm down.

588
01:09:28,566 --> 01:09:31,805
Do not raise your voice to your sister, Mehmed.

589
01:09:32,765 --> 01:09:36,245
Gonca knows nothing about it.

590
01:09:38,086 --> 01:09:42,645
It seems Alaeddin Bey fell for Gonca.

591
01:09:44,725 --> 01:09:47,845
Soon, they will send a word.

592
01:09:51,006 --> 01:09:54,205
No, mother. I won't let my
sister marry Osman's son.

593
01:09:54,326 --> 01:09:57,285
-Mehmed.
-Father.

594
01:09:57,286 --> 01:10:00,965
Don't you hear my mother? She says Osman.

595
01:10:01,086 --> 01:10:03,845
What? Will you let my sister marry Alaaddin?

596
01:10:03,966 --> 01:10:09,205
I won't answer an unasked question.

597
01:10:12,206 --> 01:10:17,325
Osman will come and ask the question.

598
01:10:20,646 --> 01:10:23,765
And he will get the answer.

599
01:10:25,366 --> 01:10:27,765
Now forget about this.

600
01:10:27,926 --> 01:10:34,885
There will no open stalls in Yenisehir market.

601
01:10:35,326 --> 01:10:39,525
You'll draw all the merchants
to the frontier market.

602
01:10:39,646 --> 01:10:44,445
Don't be worrying, my Bey. We will handle it.

603
01:10:49,126 --> 01:10:54,285
I'm giving this duty to you, Gonca.

604
01:10:54,926 --> 01:10:57,845
You will do it.

605
01:11:02,446 --> 01:11:05,325
As my bey father orders.

606
01:11:05,446 --> 01:11:08,165
-Good.
-Do I have permission, my Sultan?

607
01:11:08,286 --> 01:11:10,325
Come in.

608
01:11:10,566 --> 01:11:14,365
My Sultan, Gorklu Khan is here.

609
01:11:19,086 --> 01:11:22,045
Gorklu Khan?

610
01:11:28,326 --> 01:11:32,845
My Bey, as you ordered, Uraz Bey
and his alps deployed in Taslitepe.

611
01:11:32,846 --> 01:11:37,685
They are waiting on alert in case of an attack.

612
01:11:38,526 --> 01:11:42,885
Salur Bey and his alps
deployed in the woods of Kiragac.

613
01:11:44,646 --> 01:11:48,205
They're waiting for an attack
against Yenisehir and Bilecik.

614
01:11:48,206 --> 01:11:53,005
Either we will stop him or he won't
stop until he takes the princess.

615
01:11:53,646 --> 01:11:59,885
Now send the trained alps
to Inhisar to join Emirhan Bey.

616
01:11:59,966 --> 01:12:02,685
As you order, my Bey.

617
01:12:10,526 --> 01:12:15,605
They attacked Sogut first.

618
01:12:16,006 --> 01:12:20,405
Then they attacked Karakeciler Tribe.

619
01:12:20,486 --> 01:12:27,485
And then, as we heard, they
marched towards the inn of Kirkagac.

620
01:12:31,126 --> 01:12:33,525
It seems..

621
01:12:35,886 --> 01:12:39,045
...they will march to Domanic next.

622
01:12:39,726 --> 01:12:44,325
They'll attack the elder
and the babies in Domanic.

623
01:12:53,126 --> 01:12:56,845
-Say it, Talay Alp.
-50 more alps are ready, my Bey.

624
01:12:57,406 --> 01:13:02,365
-We'll go to Inhisar at dawn. Tell them.
-As you order, my Bey.

625
01:13:06,566 --> 01:13:10,485
My Bey, my alps and I can
leave at night and reach Domanic.

626
01:13:10,606 --> 01:13:13,965
No. We will move at dawn.

627
01:13:14,406 --> 01:13:17,685
I'll tell you when and how to attack.

628
01:13:17,806 --> 01:13:20,685
Okay, my Bey.

629
01:13:27,046 --> 01:13:32,845
Boran, you won't go to fight
with us. You'll take the princess.

630
01:13:33,126 --> 01:13:38,525
For the welfare of our country,
it's important to keep the princess.

631
01:13:39,406 --> 01:13:42,325
-As you order, my Bey.
-Go ahead.

632
01:14:41,086 --> 01:14:44,805
You know the manners, Sultan Yakup.

633
01:14:45,086 --> 01:14:48,125
You didn't welcome me on your throne.

634
01:14:48,366 --> 01:14:51,405
I don't approve your arrival either.

635
01:14:51,766 --> 01:14:54,485
Amir Gorklu Khan.

636
01:14:54,646 --> 01:14:59,325
Where is my princess, Sultan Yakup?

637
01:15:02,366 --> 01:15:08,765
If you thought I have her, you'd have
attacked Kutahya instead of Sogut.

638
01:15:09,526 --> 01:15:14,725
We both know who holds the princess.

639
01:15:15,126 --> 01:15:20,685
Osman is the enemy of both of us.

640
01:15:20,846 --> 01:15:27,685
You are right. But with one difference.

641
01:15:30,246 --> 01:15:35,365
Your enemy, my rival.

642
01:15:39,406 --> 01:15:44,925
Do you want to be crushed
together with him, Yakup?

643
01:15:46,046 --> 01:15:51,765
I neither crush nor get crushed, Amir.

644
01:15:52,006 --> 01:15:57,285
Don't you have enough power to crush Osman?

645
01:15:57,486 --> 01:16:03,005
Yakup, I have a hundred sultans
like you under my command.

646
01:16:03,246 --> 01:16:09,005
They all pay taxes, bow and keep silent.

647
01:16:10,206 --> 01:16:16,125
There is no point in trying
to keep your tail upright.

648
01:16:16,446 --> 01:16:22,365
You know you are much below our power.

649
01:16:22,646 --> 01:16:28,365
If you intend to make me turn against
you, you are walking on the right path.

650
01:16:29,006 --> 01:16:34,405
Those afraid of us cannot be turn against us.

651
01:16:36,686 --> 01:16:41,605
Hear me well now. Bring the princess...

652
01:16:41,726 --> 01:16:45,085
...and I will set you free from Ilkhanids

653
01:16:45,166 --> 01:16:50,205
..taxes and vows.

654
01:17:00,486 --> 01:17:04,365
Think carefully, Sultan.

655
01:17:13,806 --> 01:17:17,525
Mongolian dog!

656
01:17:54,206 --> 01:18:00,125
Come here, fighter. Come.

657
01:18:02,486 --> 01:18:07,685
My Bey, I'm ready. I want
to join the battle, my Bey.

658
01:18:07,846 --> 01:18:12,165
Praise be. Praise be.

659
01:18:17,646 --> 01:18:21,925
Here... Alps!

660
01:18:22,686 --> 01:18:27,245
Look at him. Look at him!

661
01:18:28,766 --> 01:18:33,965
You have this..

662
01:18:34,726 --> 01:18:40,685
...heart of a lion! You all have it!

663
01:18:43,446 --> 01:18:48,605
A heart never trying to get up even if it falls,

664
01:18:49,006 --> 01:18:53,205
...never accepting the defeat...

665
01:18:53,606 --> 01:18:58,245
...and only beating...

666
01:18:58,486 --> 01:19:03,045
...only beating to fight for Islam!

667
01:19:07,246 --> 01:19:12,125
You all have it. All of you.

668
01:19:13,166 --> 01:19:15,925
Here..

669
01:19:21,686 --> 01:19:25,485
This is what makes us different from others.

670
01:19:25,726 --> 01:19:30,165
This is what trust Turkish swords...

671
01:19:30,206 --> 01:19:32,965
..for the freedom of Turks!

672
01:19:33,046 --> 01:19:39,365
Let the others sit comfortably on their chairs!

673
01:19:39,606 --> 01:19:45,765
This is what makes us train in a cold sweat...

674
01:19:46,126 --> 01:19:48,605
...in the middle of night!

675
01:19:50,086 --> 01:19:54,525
A heart beating to fight for Islam!

676
01:19:55,046 --> 01:19:57,725
Tell me.

677
01:19:57,886 --> 01:20:01,605
-What is your heart beating for?
-To fight for Islam, my Bey!

678
01:20:01,966 --> 01:20:04,885
-What is heart beating for?
-To fight for Islam, my Bey!

679
01:20:04,926 --> 01:20:09,405
Praise be! Praise be!

680
01:20:12,606 --> 01:20:18,405
You think we didn't take this into consideration
when we started to establish the state?

681
01:20:18,726 --> 01:20:24,005
We started this journey
at the cost of many fights!

682
01:20:24,286 --> 01:20:29,125
Of course, some bey won't support us.

683
01:20:29,246 --> 01:20:34,605
Of course, some will
attempt to stab us in the back!

684
01:20:36,206 --> 01:20:40,605
Crusaders will attack from all directions.

685
01:20:40,926 --> 01:20:46,925
Mongolians will look for
an opportunity to jump on us!

686
01:20:47,606 --> 01:20:50,685
We know that.

687
01:20:51,006 --> 01:20:54,165
But remember this.

688
01:20:54,926 --> 01:21:02,365
Allah is with us! And
for sure we will be victorious!

689
01:21:04,486 --> 01:21:08,245
Alps, I have the gift of ruling!

690
01:21:08,486 --> 01:21:15,005
-For sure, I will be worthy of the title!
-Yes, my Bey!

691
01:21:20,086 --> 01:21:24,085
But I didn't...

692
01:21:24,406 --> 01:21:26,965
...know only this.

693
01:21:27,206 --> 01:21:34,085
I didn't know Byzantine would
give the princess to Mongolians...

694
01:21:34,206 --> 01:21:37,125
...to defeat us.

695
01:21:40,926 --> 01:21:47,085
Alps! Considering they're
afraid, we are on the right track!

696
01:21:47,126 --> 01:21:50,445
Thank Allah my Bey,
Thank Allah my Bey!

697
01:21:53,486 --> 01:21:58,525
Don't be worrying. For sure
we'll overcome this too.

698
01:21:58,646 --> 01:22:01,325
We will heal our wounds.

699
01:22:01,486 --> 01:22:06,805
We will avenge our martyrs
and our veterans! Don't worry!

700
01:22:07,286 --> 01:22:10,885
Now, tell me. What is your heart beating for?

701
01:22:11,086 --> 01:22:17,405
-For holy war, my Bey!
-What is your heart beating for?

702
01:22:17,486 --> 01:22:21,365
-For holy war, my Bey!
-Praise be!

703
01:22:22,526 --> 01:22:24,685
Praise be.

704
01:22:26,926 --> 01:22:29,445
Alps are ready for the holy war.

705
01:22:32,806 --> 01:22:36,565
Make your final preparations.

706
01:22:37,126 --> 01:22:43,685
-We will hit Gorklu Khan tomorrow.
-Allah is the Greatest!

707
01:22:49,726 --> 01:22:53,885
People will cause bothering,
we need to do something else.

708
01:22:53,966 --> 01:22:57,018
They say it is a matter
of life and death, but

709
01:22:57,030 --> 01:23:00,285
the real issue is taxation,
and this is disloyalty.

710
01:23:00,526 --> 01:23:04,765
Right, first the richest
merchants removed their stalls.

711
01:23:04,846 --> 01:23:08,765
But the stalls of those who are not well remain.

712
01:23:09,566 --> 01:23:15,005
We are getting rid of the rotten
ones, but this will stop our trade.

713
01:23:16,366 --> 01:23:18,405
This will put us in a hard spot, mother.

714
01:23:18,526 --> 01:23:23,325
-No, we will not let that happen.
-Of course we won't.

715
01:23:23,406 --> 01:23:28,165
From now on, we will treat those
who do not listen in a harsh way.

716
01:23:29,006 --> 01:23:31,245
Ulgen.

717
01:23:32,766 --> 01:23:35,525
I said Ulgen.

718
01:23:35,606 --> 01:23:38,725
-Yes?
-What's wrong with you?

719
01:23:38,806 --> 01:23:41,965
You've been very quiet since morning.

720
01:23:42,046 --> 01:23:46,365
No, nothing wrong, I'm all right.

721
01:23:49,726 --> 01:23:55,485
Brother. Did you see Gonca
Hatun after the marketplace?

722
01:23:55,606 --> 01:23:59,365
-I did, she was all right.
-Did you see her?

723
01:23:59,766 --> 01:24:05,205
-Didn't we talk, son?
-I learned the truth, mother.

724
01:24:07,326 --> 01:24:12,645
Mother. Saadet Hatun tried to
slap when she saw Gonca Hatun

725
01:24:12,726 --> 01:24:14,380
-and my brother together.

726
01:24:14,392 --> 01:24:17,725
Look at her, praise be
to my beautiful daughter.

727
01:24:17,926 --> 01:24:21,645
Why haven't you told this until now?

728
01:24:22,966 --> 01:24:27,885
Saadet Hatun forbade Gonca to see me.

729
01:24:28,486 --> 01:24:32,765
What Ulgen Hatun heard was not right.

730
01:24:43,606 --> 01:24:45,845
My Hatun?

731
01:24:47,686 --> 01:24:52,645
Did I do something wrong? Why
are you looking at me like that.

732
01:24:54,486 --> 01:24:58,005
Don't you know what you did, Guice?

733
01:24:59,966 --> 01:25:06,205
Didn't you betray me? Didn't you
rat me out to my mother, Guice?

734
01:25:09,566 --> 01:25:13,645
-Gonca Hatun, I...
-Shush.

735
01:25:16,566 --> 01:25:20,405
I thought you were my friend, Guice.

736
01:25:20,606 --> 01:25:24,045
But you were my mother's friend.

737
01:25:26,126 --> 01:25:28,925
It is over.

738
01:25:29,166 --> 01:25:33,005
I don't want to see you around me again.

739
01:25:33,486 --> 01:25:37,245
Tawba, I will not do it again.

740
01:25:37,966 --> 01:25:41,645
Don't keep me away from you.

741
01:25:42,286 --> 01:25:47,165
No. I don't trust you anymore.

742
01:25:47,846 --> 01:25:53,045
One cannot be a companion with
someone whose back one cannot turn, Guice.

743
01:25:59,006 --> 01:26:03,245
What are you doing here?

744
01:26:09,606 --> 01:26:13,885
I'm getting information from
Guice for my duty, mother.

745
01:26:14,646 --> 01:26:18,765
Today, you disobeyed me again, Gonca.

746
01:26:19,126 --> 01:26:24,165
If I hadn't come, you would
have told Alaeddin everything.

747
01:26:30,006 --> 01:26:35,965
Yes. I was going to, mother. But
you had someone to watch me, right?

748
01:26:37,406 --> 01:26:39,885
Do you know?

749
01:26:40,766 --> 01:26:45,805
When you cannot trust your mother, you
feel like you're all alone in the desert.

750
01:26:46,086 --> 01:26:52,245
You went to that desert
willingly. Do not blame me for it.

751
01:26:53,566 --> 01:26:59,725
You will not disobey me again.
You will not see Alaeddin, Gonca.

752
01:27:00,246 --> 01:27:04,325
I have a duty, if you'll excuse me, mother.

753
01:27:04,526 --> 01:27:09,765
You heard your brother and father.
They know about Alaeddin now.

754
01:27:11,486 --> 01:27:16,445
If he gets close to you, you'll
see what Mehmed will do to him.

755
01:27:17,526 --> 01:27:22,085
Mother, mother, why are you doing this to me?

756
01:27:22,366 --> 01:27:25,725
For you to see. For you to see that

757
01:27:25,966 --> 01:27:30,045
you will not be together with
Alaeddin without my consent.

758
01:27:31,446 --> 01:27:37,405
If you'd listened to me and be reasonable
I was going to convince everyone

759
01:27:37,606 --> 01:27:41,165
and I was going to marry
you off to him on my own.

760
01:27:42,486 --> 01:27:46,525
Don't get excited because your
father didn't say anything at dinner.

761
01:27:46,566 --> 01:27:51,045
She has a suitable groom candidate in his mind.

762
01:27:56,566 --> 01:28:00,965
You wanted this, daughter.

763
01:28:01,126 --> 01:28:04,965
Now you're paying the price of your choices.

764
01:28:06,806 --> 01:28:12,005
My so-called friend turned out
to be my enemy. Alaeddin Bey...

765
01:28:12,126 --> 01:28:16,045
You set eyes on my loved one.

766
01:28:16,246 --> 01:28:19,485
Ah... But

767
01:28:20,726 --> 01:28:23,445
she wouldn't pick him while I'm here.

768
01:28:24,886 --> 01:28:29,925
She would. Shahzade is tall.

769
01:28:30,446 --> 01:28:34,525
And he's strong. And about his intelligence...

770
01:28:34,646 --> 01:28:40,605
...he's one of the most intelligent ones.
He's not ugly, rather, he's pretty handsome.

771
01:28:40,806 --> 01:28:44,885
How am I going to fight with this shahzade?

772
01:28:45,126 --> 01:28:48,405
-Mother?
-What am I going to do?

773
01:28:48,926 --> 01:28:52,805
-Mother?
-What am I going to do?

774
01:28:53,166 --> 01:28:55,805
What am I going to do, what if Saadet is right?

775
01:28:55,926 --> 01:29:00,325
Mother, I'm telling you! I'm losing Gonca Hatun!

776
01:29:00,526 --> 01:29:03,605
-What if Saadet is right?
-Mother?

777
01:29:04,326 --> 01:29:08,965
Osman Bey will not forgive treason.
Cerkutay...

778
01:29:10,566 --> 01:29:16,205
-My Allah, protect us.
-Mother, from what will Allah protect us?

779
01:29:20,726 --> 01:29:23,274
Ulgen Hatun, what are
you doing? You've been

780
01:29:23,286 --> 01:29:26,125
trying to hide every time
you see me since morning.

781
01:29:26,206 --> 01:29:29,965
She's very tense right now, father.

782
01:29:30,966 --> 01:29:36,245
Go. Go to the kitchen and eat halwa, come on.

783
01:29:38,246 --> 01:29:40,845
-Look at me.
-Yes, my Hatun.

784
01:29:40,926 --> 01:29:43,925
Are you spying?

785
01:29:45,006 --> 01:29:49,485
-What are you saying, Ulgen?
-You're spying, that's why you're so afraid.

786
01:29:49,726 --> 01:29:53,525
Cerkutay, what have you done?
How could you do this to Osman Bey?

787
01:29:53,606 --> 01:29:58,765
I didn't do anything. I didn't
say anything to anyone.

788
01:29:59,566 --> 01:30:04,605
-If I did, I tried to gain time...
-You put us in such a hell that...

789
01:30:04,926 --> 01:30:07,525
...there's no way out.

790
01:30:08,726 --> 01:30:12,605
Osman Bey will kill you if he hears about it.

791
01:30:13,646 --> 01:30:16,725
Not only you, he will kill all of us.

792
01:30:16,806 --> 01:30:21,325
-Whoever told this to you...
-I didn't know you at all.

793
01:30:22,886 --> 01:30:25,925
None.

794
01:30:31,246 --> 01:30:34,645
No one knew me.

795
01:30:47,566 --> 01:30:50,805
Who was I?

796
01:30:56,286 --> 01:30:58,805
What was my name?

797
01:31:01,846 --> 01:31:03,965
Cerkutay.

798
01:31:12,086 --> 01:31:19,605
Salah(prayer) is better than sleep

799
01:31:19,846 --> 01:31:28,965
Allah is the Greatest Allah is the Greatest

800
01:31:29,086 --> 01:31:36,605
There is none worthy of worship except Allah,

801
01:31:36,686 --> 01:31:39,805
Allah is the Greatest

802
01:32:25,006 --> 01:32:28,885
May you be safe from evil, and Mercy of Allah be upon you

803
01:32:30,046 --> 01:32:34,565
May you be safe from evil, and Mercy of Allah be upon you

804
01:33:03,046 --> 01:33:07,485
Tribes and inns are being attacked

805
01:33:07,566 --> 01:33:10,525
but the princess is nowhere to be found.

806
01:33:11,286 --> 01:33:15,925
Our nokers will attack more places.

807
01:33:15,966 --> 01:33:18,685
Where will we march to, Emir Gorklu Khan?

808
01:33:18,726 --> 01:33:22,645
Now, it is time for Domanic.

809
01:33:22,766 --> 01:33:25,445
Tell nokers to prepare.

810
01:33:25,526 --> 01:33:29,885
We won't stop until we have the princess.

811
01:33:48,846 --> 01:33:54,285
Gorklu Khan. Our noker
at Kestel sent his report.

812
01:33:54,366 --> 01:33:56,685
Osman's son Orhan is at Kestel.

813
01:33:59,526 --> 01:34:03,365
-Tell me.
-He is not alone.

814
01:34:03,766 --> 01:34:07,005
Lord's daughter Holofira is with him.

815
01:34:08,166 --> 01:34:10,245
The lone sheep..

816
01:34:10,326 --> 01:34:13,445
Is in danger of who, commander?

817
01:34:13,886 --> 01:34:16,365
The wolf.

818
01:34:21,366 --> 01:34:26,085
Osman. He is playing with my reputation..

819
01:34:26,366 --> 01:34:30,245
By taking the princess.

820
01:34:30,366 --> 01:34:35,765
I will destroy his reputation.

821
01:34:41,446 --> 01:34:45,565
Bring that girl to me.

822
01:34:45,886 --> 01:34:48,045
As you command, Emir Gorklu Khan.

823
01:34:49,926 --> 01:34:51,205
Come on.

824
01:34:52,686 --> 01:34:57,045
Let's see then..

825
01:34:57,206 --> 01:35:00,925
If he will give the princess..

826
01:35:01,046 --> 01:35:05,125
Or not.

827
01:35:15,566 --> 01:35:18,685
My lord, from the spy inside.

828
01:35:24,126 --> 01:35:27,005
Osman.

829
01:35:27,126 --> 01:35:31,045
Knows that we will arrive at Domanic.

830
01:35:31,246 --> 01:35:34,045
Good.

831
01:35:35,646 --> 01:35:38,045
Come on, come on!

832
01:36:11,566 --> 01:36:13,365
Holofira.

833
01:36:24,006 --> 01:36:25,885
I am not hungry.

834
01:36:30,326 --> 01:36:33,005
Holofira.

835
01:36:33,806 --> 01:36:36,365
I am heading out for duty.

836
01:36:37,166 --> 01:36:39,925
Osman Bey is waiting for me.

837
01:36:40,046 --> 01:36:43,685
-However, I wanted to..
-Imprison me.

838
01:36:45,286 --> 01:36:48,245
And you will go now, Orhan?

839
01:36:50,526 --> 01:36:54,565
Mongols. They ambushed Sogut.

840
01:36:54,846 --> 01:37:00,565
-It is bad.
-Jesus Christ protect them.

841
01:37:02,886 --> 01:37:05,085
Holofira look.

842
01:37:05,166 --> 01:37:08,605
Do not try to do what you did yesterday.

843
01:37:08,686 --> 01:37:12,885
Mongols are outside. Do
not make me worry about you.

844
01:37:13,486 --> 01:37:17,685
Mongols you say. If my
aunt comes on top of that..

845
01:37:18,446 --> 01:37:22,845
Look, Orhan. Send me back.

846
01:37:23,486 --> 01:37:28,005
I worry sick that something's
going to happen to you.

847
01:37:30,686 --> 01:37:36,125
Nothing will happen to me Daughter of the Lord.

848
01:37:38,766 --> 01:37:41,645
Now, I want you to promise me.

849
01:37:41,846 --> 01:37:45,525
-To not run.
-No, when I come back..

850
01:37:45,926 --> 01:37:49,325
I will visit the Christian people.

851
01:37:50,486 --> 01:37:55,005
However, if you want to..

852
01:37:55,126 --> 01:37:59,085
Are you trying to soften me up
using the people of my religion now?

853
01:37:59,206 --> 01:38:03,205
You got it quick Holofira Hatun.

854
01:38:03,646 --> 01:38:08,245
Alright. I will help you.

855
01:38:09,286 --> 01:38:14,125
Of course, you can not do without me.

856
01:38:15,566 --> 01:38:19,645
So you will wait for me. You gave me a promise.

857
01:38:19,766 --> 01:38:22,685
From now on, no getting away.

858
01:38:23,006 --> 01:38:27,285
Alright. I will wait, I promise.

859
01:38:27,926 --> 01:38:31,005
However, you will give me a promise as well.

860
01:38:32,606 --> 01:38:36,445
You will come back for sure, alright?

861
01:38:38,766 --> 01:38:41,085
I will.

862
01:38:43,926 --> 01:38:46,405
I will come back..

863
01:38:47,326 --> 01:38:52,085
And look at these eyes again. I promise.

864
01:38:57,926 --> 01:39:00,845
Now I have to go.

865
01:39:01,966 --> 01:39:05,445
However, my heart remains
here, Daughter of the Lord.

866
01:39:05,966 --> 01:39:08,405
You know that.

867
01:39:29,486 --> 01:39:35,205
I know. I know, Orhan.

868
01:39:55,366 --> 01:39:58,125
They're coming.

869
01:40:07,206 --> 01:40:09,565
Let them come. Come on.

870
01:40:37,206 --> 01:40:42,845
So you're the one they call "Gorklu Khan".

871
01:40:42,926 --> 01:40:49,405
And you are the impertinent
Osman, who took my princess.

872
01:40:49,566 --> 01:40:52,605
I know why you are marrying her.

873
01:40:53,966 --> 01:40:59,965
You want to walk over me
by uniting with Byzantine.

874
01:41:00,446 --> 01:41:03,325
You think I would not take the princess..

875
01:41:03,766 --> 01:41:07,005
And let my home get destroyed?

876
01:41:08,886 --> 01:41:14,445
Knowing your place is not bowing to cruelty.

877
01:41:15,286 --> 01:41:19,245
Everyone knows us well. Now you..

878
01:41:19,806 --> 01:41:25,365
Will meet the executioner
of the cruels that is my sword.

879
01:41:27,166 --> 01:41:30,765
And I will have you and those behind you..

880
01:41:30,966 --> 01:41:35,925
Meet my wrath. Nokers!

881
01:41:42,886 --> 01:41:48,365
We do not get scared because you're few..

882
01:41:48,566 --> 01:41:51,405
Or because you're many.

883
01:41:51,486 --> 01:41:57,045
Then I will teach you fear.

884
01:41:57,406 --> 01:42:00,485
It is above you, Osman.

885
01:42:00,806 --> 01:42:04,485
Maybe you will learn it the hard way..

886
01:42:04,606 --> 01:42:08,245
However, if those behind you manage to survive..

887
01:42:08,326 --> 01:42:13,245
They will remember
today in fear for all eternity.

888
01:42:15,206 --> 01:42:19,325
The sheep that knows its death..

889
01:42:19,446 --> 01:42:22,365
Licks the butcher's knife.

890
01:42:23,886 --> 01:42:28,245
You are facing the wrong man, Osman.

891
01:42:28,726 --> 01:42:34,765
We will see. Sheep or wolf.

892
01:42:35,886 --> 01:42:38,765
Now you are in my hunting field.

893
01:42:40,046 --> 01:42:44,365
-Archers!
-Ya Hakk!

894
01:42:56,006 --> 01:43:01,165
Now, the field is ours! Alps, attack!

895
01:43:01,286 --> 01:43:03,885
Come on brothers!

896
01:45:05,006 --> 01:45:07,845
My Bey!

897
01:45:17,326 --> 01:45:20,005
Gorklu!

898
01:45:20,886 --> 01:45:25,525
If there will be no sleep to us,
there will be none to you as well!

899
01:45:26,646 --> 01:45:30,725
Alps! Fall back!

900
01:45:38,006 --> 01:45:41,885
Will we strike Domanic my Emir?
-No.

901
01:45:42,326 --> 01:45:46,765
Let the commander not arrive empty handed.

902
01:45:47,326 --> 01:45:51,365
Osman will bow to me..

903
01:45:51,566 --> 01:45:54,205
With his own hands.

904
01:45:54,846 --> 01:45:59,165
-Come on.
-Nokers.

905
01:46:12,326 --> 01:46:16,285
My lady. Will we wait like this?

906
01:46:16,446 --> 01:46:20,805
We will, Andra. What about your aunt?

907
01:46:21,046 --> 01:46:25,365
-Are you not afraid of her anymore? -I am.

908
01:46:26,526 --> 01:46:29,285
I am very afraid of her.

909
01:46:29,806 --> 01:46:33,965
However, I gave a promise to Orhan. I will wait.

910
01:46:35,566 --> 01:46:38,285
Come on, quickly!

911
01:46:42,206 --> 01:46:45,285
Andra, something bad is happening.

912
01:46:45,406 --> 01:46:47,685
Holofira Hatun, Mongols are attacking.

913
01:46:47,886 --> 01:46:51,005
How did they enter the castle?
Does Orhan knows of this?

914
01:46:51,086 --> 01:46:55,405
They must've bought a guy from
inside. Doors are open, they are inside.

915
01:46:55,486 --> 01:46:58,325
-We will hide you.
-Come on.

916
01:47:01,166 --> 01:47:05,165
-Where is princess's room?
-Ahead.

917
01:47:34,486 --> 01:47:37,285
This is her room.

918
01:47:38,166 --> 01:47:41,245
Come on.

919
01:47:45,966 --> 01:47:50,872
-Where is the rest of the
gold? I brought you here.

920
01:47:50,884 --> 01:47:52,925
Your gold will come.

921
01:47:55,046 --> 01:47:58,005
Commander, princess is missing.

922
01:48:00,166 --> 01:48:05,885
This is her room. How could this
be? She was supposed to be inside.

923
01:48:07,286 --> 01:48:12,325
They will take her from the
passage. We must have her, quickly.

924
01:48:12,526 --> 01:48:16,405
The secret passage is
behind this door. Let us move!

925
01:48:32,926 --> 01:48:36,685
-Where are you going?
-What do you want from me?

926
01:48:36,886 --> 01:48:40,085
Don't be scared. For Princess Maria.

927
01:48:40,326 --> 01:48:43,605
They will give her, and they will take you.

928
01:48:46,206 --> 01:48:49,085
Of course, if they want you.

929
01:48:50,006 --> 01:48:51,427
Now drop your sword.

930
01:48:51,439 --> 01:48:53,965
I will never
surrender to a Mongol!

931
01:48:54,326 --> 01:48:57,965
Look... I do not hurt women.

932
01:48:58,406 --> 01:49:02,125
But her survival is in your hands.

933
01:49:03,286 --> 01:49:06,165
Come on.

934
01:49:10,446 --> 01:49:13,845
Nokers. Take these women.

935
01:49:14,766 --> 01:49:20,725
You will pay for this! You
will not get away with this!

936
01:50:03,886 --> 01:50:07,125
Bahadir Alp is coming, my Shahzade.

937
01:50:09,206 --> 01:50:11,525
My Shahzade! -Bahadir!

938
01:50:11,726 --> 01:50:14,685
Why aren't you in Kestel, huh?
-My Shahzade, Mongols...

939
01:50:14,846 --> 01:50:18,205
What happened to Mongols,
Bahadir? Cut it short, speak!

940
01:50:18,366 --> 01:50:21,845
They sneaked in Kestel.
-Holofira...

941
01:50:21,926 --> 01:50:22,952
Is Holofira safe?

942
01:50:22,964 --> 01:50:24,925
They abducted
Princess Holofira.

943
01:50:25,006 --> 01:50:28,805
Why did I place you there,
huh? What were you doing?

944
01:50:29,086 --> 01:50:31,005
Where did they go? Speak!

945
01:50:31,086 --> 01:50:33,285
We went after them until Cinarbasi, but...

946
01:50:33,486 --> 01:50:36,685
.then we lost them. I gave you horses!

947
01:50:36,766 --> 01:50:41,125
I gave you swords! But you let me down!

948
01:50:41,406 --> 01:50:49,205
I entrusted our lands and people to you!
But you could not protect them! Get lost!

949
01:50:51,686 --> 01:50:57,445
Alps! We are going to
Cinarbasi! No matter what...

950
01:50:57,966 --> 01:51:02,845
...we will save Holofira!
-Yes, my Shahzade.

951
01:51:06,686 --> 01:51:10,125
The injured people are alright,
my Bey. They will recover.

952
01:51:10,206 --> 01:51:14,605
But I didn't understand how we fell for
an ambush while going for an ambush.

953
01:51:16,086 --> 01:51:19,725
We stopped the Domanic raid...

954
01:51:20,246 --> 01:51:24,325
It's about that. But the actual issue is...

955
01:51:25,006 --> 01:51:28,685
...getting raid while going for a raid.

956
01:51:28,966 --> 01:51:32,485
It means there is a spy among us.

957
01:51:32,686 --> 01:51:35,485
But we know who it is.

958
01:51:35,566 --> 01:51:38,245
Talay dog.

959
01:51:38,846 --> 01:51:42,485
First, he took advantage of
the injured people in Sogut.

960
01:51:42,566 --> 01:51:47,845
Thanks to Allah, Talay Alp
was here. He fought like a man.

961
01:51:48,086 --> 01:51:50,485
He made up a story to show himself as a hero.

962
01:51:50,766 --> 01:51:54,485
It was our duty, my Bey. But I feel
sorry because we were not enough.

963
01:51:55,726 --> 01:52:01,085
He approached us to hear
the details about Domanic raid.

964
01:52:04,606 --> 01:52:10,125
And the ambush... He did his
best to avoid killing Mongols.

965
01:52:11,406 --> 01:52:15,245
It was that dog who made
our move unsuccessful...

966
01:52:15,726 --> 01:52:22,245
...it was him, but... We will
plan the actual game over him.

967
01:52:24,246 --> 01:52:29,765
Ours is the dream of a
glorious state ruling the world.

968
01:52:30,566 --> 01:52:34,645
We will not let the cruel and the traitors win.

969
01:52:34,766 --> 01:52:39,165
Whoever comes, for sure we will crush them.

970
01:52:39,286 --> 01:52:43,325
Sure my Bey. How
will we plan our game then?

971
01:52:44,606 --> 01:52:47,165
They want the Princess.

972
01:52:50,646 --> 01:52:54,085
I will give them the Princess.

973
01:53:05,126 --> 01:53:08,645
Won't you talk to me, Gonca Hatun?

974
01:53:08,886 --> 01:53:11,285
I had to.

975
01:53:11,526 --> 01:53:15,165
Saadet Hatun gave me the duty. What could I do?

976
01:53:16,046 --> 01:53:19,245
She doesn't even pity you.

977
01:53:19,406 --> 01:53:22,325
What would she do to me if I didn't tell her?

978
01:53:24,334 --> 01:53:27,644
If you had told me, I'd have found a solution

979
01:53:30,616 --> 01:53:32,756
But you acted behind my back, Gulce.

980
01:53:36,012 --> 01:53:39,822
Saadet Hatun sent news to The Sisters
to marry you.

981
01:53:40,477 --> 01:53:43,727
-What?
-I heard them talking.

982
01:53:47,660 --> 01:53:49,750
She'll do what she has said.

983
01:53:51,138 --> 01:53:53,738
She'll make me marry someone.

984
01:53:54,779 --> 01:54:00,249
Don't let her find out I told you.
I won't do anything without informin you again.

985
01:54:06,366 --> 01:54:08,725
Gonca Hatun. The caravans are approaching.

986
01:54:08,966 --> 01:54:11,805
Good. Let's welcome them.

987
01:54:11,966 --> 01:54:16,045
Come on! Come on!

988
01:54:23,406 --> 01:54:27,525
Mother... What will happen if the goods do not arrive?

989
01:54:28,126 --> 01:54:30,965
Then we will find another solution, my daughter.

990
01:54:31,166 --> 01:54:34,085
Welcome... Welcome Malhun Hatun.

991
01:54:34,886 --> 01:54:38,805
Kayi's loyal, foul-weather friends...

992
01:54:38,966 --> 01:54:40,925
...brothers, sisters...

993
01:54:41,006 --> 01:54:44,565
You never hesitated to stand behind us.

994
01:54:44,726 --> 01:54:48,285
You never stepped back. Thank you all!

995
01:54:48,366 --> 01:54:52,285
Thank you, Malhun Hatun. May Allah bless you.

996
01:54:55,846 --> 01:55:00,085
Ulgen... Tell the clerk to write down the names of our traders.

997
01:55:00,166 --> 01:55:04,725
From now on, all the needs in the Bey Palace will be
purchased from these counters.

998
01:55:04,886 --> 01:55:07,045
None of their goods will be wasted.

999
01:55:07,126 --> 01:55:10,285
May Allah bless you!

1000
01:55:10,806 --> 01:55:15,525
May Allah bless you..

1001
01:55:20,486 --> 01:55:24,005
Haven't you heard from your brother yet, my daughter?

1002
01:55:24,126 --> 01:55:27,925
I am sorry, my brother... I could only last this long.

1003
01:55:28,406 --> 01:55:30,565
What happened?

1004
01:55:32,326 --> 01:55:35,845
Mother... I can't
stand it anymore.

1005
01:55:36,246 --> 01:55:39,685
My brother.. -What?

1006
01:55:40,486 --> 01:55:43,645
..abducted Holofira.

1007
01:55:43,726 --> 01:55:45,845
What are you saying, Fatma?

1008
01:55:46,806 --> 01:55:49,205
Why haven't you told me?

1009
01:55:49,286 --> 01:55:52,325
Don't be angry with me, it's not my fault, mother.

1010
01:55:55,406 --> 01:55:57,845
Oh, Orhan.

1011
01:55:58,726 --> 01:56:01,085
Malhun Hatun.

1012
01:56:01,206 --> 01:56:05,205
Malhun Hatun, Karacelasun attacked Kestel.

1013
01:56:05,366 --> 01:56:07,525
He kidnapped Holofira Hatun.

1014
01:56:10,206 --> 01:56:12,645
My Allah, protect us.

1015
01:56:16,406 --> 01:56:19,925
-Konur, tell me. How's it going?
-As you ordered, my Bey.

1016
01:56:20,086 --> 01:56:23,365
Some of the alps are in Domanic.

1017
01:56:23,806 --> 01:56:26,285
Domanic

1018
01:56:27,326 --> 01:56:30,405
is not the target anymore.

1019
01:56:34,766 --> 01:56:37,645
The news is about to reach Tabriz.

1020
01:56:37,846 --> 01:56:41,685
Gorklu Khan will attack even harder.

1021
01:56:42,166 --> 01:56:47,405
As long as he cannot find the Princess, he will try all the lands.

1022
01:56:49,206 --> 01:56:52,205
What is your order, my Bey?

1023
01:56:52,646 --> 01:56:56,125
We'll go all the way. We will not stop.

1024
01:56:57,046 --> 01:56:59,965
If we are going to be destroyed

1025
01:57:01,246 --> 01:57:03,765
we will take him with us.

1026
01:57:08,446 --> 01:57:11,685
Inform Boran, tell him to

1027
01:57:11,806 --> 01:57:15,885
take the Princess to Taskesen.

1028
01:57:16,246 --> 01:57:19,085
It is the safest place for now.

1029
01:57:22,406 --> 01:57:24,805
Yes, my Bey.

1030
01:57:25,326 --> 01:57:28,565
-Make preparations.
-Yes, my Bey.

1031
01:57:29,406 --> 01:57:31,965
Come on alps.

1032
01:57:38,406 --> 01:57:40,685
Stop!

1033
01:57:48,766 --> 01:57:52,005
What are you doing, Bala Hatun? Shahzade Alaeddin?

1034
01:57:52,246 --> 01:57:57,645
Those who do not stand by their friends in bad times
should not stand by them in good times.

1035
01:58:00,566 --> 01:58:03,405
Turn the cars around, the goods will go to Yenisehir.

1036
01:58:03,646 --> 01:58:07,925
We said what we had to say, we will trade
in the frontier marketplace from now on.

1037
01:58:08,006 --> 01:58:13,285
You've heard my Valide.
Do not make her repeat, turn the cars around!

1038
01:58:14,246 --> 01:58:18,405
I know how fond you are of money. Don't worry.

1039
01:58:18,486 --> 01:58:23,165
You'll get plenty of money back.
We don't violate anyone's right.

1040
01:58:25,326 --> 01:58:28,925
Kismet, give them their money.

1041
01:59:00,046 --> 01:59:05,645
Hasan. Memorize all the merchants here one by one.

1042
01:59:05,966 --> 01:59:10,485
From now on, they will not be able to trade in Kayi lands.

1043
01:59:10,886 --> 01:59:15,765
-Let everyone know.
-Yes, my Shahzade.

1044
01:59:16,366 --> 01:59:19,885
My Shahzade, what are we going to do?
Who are we going to trade with?

1045
01:59:21,006 --> 01:59:24,645
What's going on here?

1046
01:59:26,526 --> 01:59:30,045
Bala Hatun? Alaeddin Bey?

1047
01:59:31,806 --> 01:59:35,805
We've taken what is ours, we're leaving, Gonca Hatun.

1048
01:59:36,286 --> 01:59:38,685
Come on, let's take the cars.

1049
01:59:38,766 --> 01:59:45,405
You intimidate traders who voluntarily come to the
frontier marketplace and threaten them into turning back.

1050
01:59:47,646 --> 01:59:50,765
I won't let you do that. Sisters!

1051
01:59:50,846 --> 01:59:53,405
We're not threatening anyone.

1052
01:59:54,286 --> 01:59:57,125
We've given their money and we've taken the goods.

1053
01:59:57,126 --> 02:00:00,765
We said that we will cut the trade if they go to frontier marketplace.

1054
02:00:00,766 --> 02:00:03,925
-Here's the path, they can go if they want.
-No.

1055
02:00:04,486 --> 02:00:06,965
This is not right, Bala Hatun.

1056
02:00:09,246 --> 02:00:13,925
Trickster Hatun. Go back to your marketplace.

1057
02:00:14,046 --> 02:00:19,565
It is my duty to protect these merchants, Alaeddin Bey, do not stop me.

1058
02:00:19,686 --> 02:00:21,645
Your father deceived our merchants.

1059
02:00:21,726 --> 02:00:24,205
I told you not to talk badly about my father.

1060
02:00:24,286 --> 02:00:26,765
Do not force me to do things I do not want to do.

1061
02:00:26,846 --> 02:00:28,525
Enough!

1062
02:00:32,646 --> 02:00:38,325
Tell me now, do you still want to go to the frontier marketplace?

1063
02:00:43,886 --> 02:00:49,965
Whoever is going to take goods to the frontier marketplace
should take his bed and go. -Let them come!

1064
02:00:51,046 --> 02:00:53,805
They are more than welcome.

1065
02:00:53,886 --> 02:00:59,125
Yakup Bey's marketplace and lands are open to anyone, thanks to Allah.

1066
02:00:59,206 --> 02:01:04,445
We do not need people who sell their homeland for money, the choice is yours.

1067
02:01:05,366 --> 02:01:08,645
We are going back to Yenisehir, then.

1068
02:01:12,766 --> 02:01:16,885
And we will go to the frontier marketplace.

1069
02:01:18,886 --> 02:01:22,445
Very well the, come on. Let everyone go their own way.

1070
02:01:22,766 --> 02:01:26,685
Come on sisters, we're leaving.
Come on.

1071
02:01:29,886 --> 02:01:33,005
Come on.

1072
02:01:46,686 --> 02:01:49,125
What are you looking at?

1073
02:01:49,966 --> 02:01:53,005
What will you ask for? Tell me.

1074
02:02:02,206 --> 02:02:05,405
Make way.

1075
02:02:08,606 --> 02:02:14,005
The end of your barbarism will be disastrous for you.
I swear by Jesus Christ.

1076
02:02:14,206 --> 02:02:19,045
They will kill you all when they find me.

1077
02:02:19,126 --> 02:02:21,765
I will watch it with pleasure.

1078
02:02:25,806 --> 02:02:29,085
No one can find you as long as we do not want it.

1079
02:02:30,326 --> 02:02:33,685
Forget about it, do not get excited for it, Princess.

1080
02:02:34,006 --> 02:02:36,965
I can see the fear in your eyes, Turk.

1081
02:02:37,206 --> 02:02:42,125
I'm sure that Gorklu Khan is close, otherwise
why would we switch places so often?

1082
02:02:42,286 --> 02:02:46,485
It's refreshing to change places, why else would we do it?

1083
02:02:47,886 --> 02:02:51,205
We've been on the road for so long, you must be hungry, here.

1084
02:02:51,286 --> 02:02:53,165
I don't want it.

1085
02:02:53,526 --> 02:02:58,325
I will not eat your food. Insolent Turks.

1086
02:03:01,006 --> 02:03:04,685
If you wait for them to find you, you'll starve to death.

1087
02:03:04,846 --> 02:03:08,285
-Just saying.
-I'd rather die honorably

1088
02:03:08,446 --> 02:03:12,205
-than eat your food.
-EyvAllah.

1089
02:03:18,446 --> 02:03:22,485
We have news from Osman Bey.

1090
02:03:43,806 --> 02:03:47,325
Come on, Princess.
We're leaving.

1091
02:03:51,006 --> 02:03:54,805
Near Osman Bey's Headquarters

1092
02:04:17,966 --> 02:04:21,685
You'll die when Gorklu Khan finds out about Princess, Osman.

1093
02:04:24,606 --> 02:04:26,685
Osman Bey!

1094
02:04:32,166 --> 02:04:35,165
Osman Bey, right.

1095
02:04:37,926 --> 02:04:43,285
Look at me. Look at me.

1096
02:04:45,886 --> 02:04:51,125
You inform Gorklu Khan about every move I make, is that so?

1097
02:04:52,126 --> 02:04:56,325
You ambushed me when I went to lay an ambush, is that so?

1098
02:05:00,166 --> 02:05:04,925
Osman... So you opened your eyes.

1099
02:05:05,406 --> 02:05:07,885
But it is too late now.

1100
02:05:09,046 --> 02:05:13,005
Gorklu Khan knows about Princess.

1101
02:05:16,446 --> 02:05:20,845
But you will die now!

1102
02:05:30,326 --> 02:05:35,205
Look at me. Look at me!

1103
02:05:39,886 --> 02:05:43,965
I knew about you before.

1104
02:05:44,046 --> 02:05:48,045
But you are the one...

1105
02:05:48,366 --> 02:05:50,845
...to take me to Gorklu Khan.

1106
02:05:51,646 --> 02:05:56,405
Princess... A trap, huh?

1107
02:05:57,846 --> 02:06:04,565
Yes. He will go to the death while going to the princess.

1108
02:06:09,006 --> 02:06:11,725
Get him up.

1109
02:06:22,326 --> 02:06:26,325
I will walk on the path...

1110
02:06:26,606 --> 02:06:29,765
..of being a state with solid steps.

1111
02:06:33,486 --> 02:06:37,605
But you the cruel... You the treacherous...

1112
02:06:38,726 --> 02:06:43,885
..will be crushed under my feet...

1113
02:06:44,126 --> 02:06:47,605
...on my path.

1114
02:06:56,806 --> 02:07:02,365
I won't forgive anyone against me for this cause.

1115
02:07:02,606 --> 02:07:05,485
I will crush everyone.

1116
02:07:06,406 --> 02:07:09,685
What is next, my Bey?

1117
02:07:10,686 --> 02:07:14,885
Prepare this dog for Gorklu Khan.

1118
02:07:15,206 --> 02:07:17,725
Okay, my Bey.

1119
02:07:19,366 --> 02:07:22,085
Come on, alps.

1120
02:07:26,686 --> 02:07:29,245
Come on!

1121
02:07:34,326 --> 02:07:38,965
I will move with the ones here.
I will shut their mouths.

1122
02:07:41,486 --> 02:07:43,885
Let's go.

1123
02:07:56,726 --> 02:07:59,125
You're putting me in a hard situation.

1124
02:07:59,206 --> 02:08:01,685
Anyone can hear or see!

1125
02:08:01,966 --> 02:08:04,325
Only you concern me now

1126
02:08:04,486 --> 02:08:07,965
Oh really? What happened?
You weren't saying so before.

1127
02:08:07,966 --> 02:08:11,005
Before, we both were doing our duties.

1128
02:08:11,006 --> 02:08:16,525
But when it comes to duty, you get angry.

1129
02:08:18,286 --> 02:08:20,765
Scholar.

1130
02:08:21,406 --> 02:08:26,125
My mother told my brother and father about you.

1131
02:08:26,326 --> 02:08:30,445
-Did they say anything to you?
-No.

1132
02:08:30,566 --> 02:08:34,605
-She didn't tell them she saw us together.
-Fine. No problem then.

1133
02:08:34,646 --> 02:08:38,685
Is this fearlessness too much?

1134
02:08:40,806 --> 02:08:43,205
I'm afraid of only one thing.

1135
02:08:43,406 --> 02:08:46,485
Words to come out of this beauty's mouth.

1136
02:08:48,166 --> 02:08:52,125
Come on. Give me your answer.

1137
02:08:52,406 --> 02:08:56,965
This is too hard, Scholar. My brother got mad
when he even heard your name.

1138
02:08:57,286 --> 02:09:01,885
Sorry but Mehmed Bey is always mad.

1139
02:09:03,966 --> 02:09:10,285
Tell me now. Is your heart beating together with mine?

1140
02:09:11,486 --> 02:09:17,165
They always called me Gonca the Fearless, you know.

1141
02:09:17,846 --> 02:09:21,125
Until you came into my life.

1142
02:09:22,686 --> 02:09:25,565
I have fears.

1143
02:09:26,526 --> 02:09:30,285
My heart and mind are always on alert.

1144
02:09:30,486 --> 02:09:34,925
They always miss you and and want to know about you.

1145
02:09:38,606 --> 02:09:43,525
You aren't going to kill me with your sword, but your words.

1146
02:09:46,246 --> 02:09:49,445
Since the day I first saw you

1147
02:09:50,686 --> 02:09:55,085
...my heart has been beating together with yours, Alaaddin Ali.

1148
02:09:58,006 --> 02:10:04,325
Allah! Allah Allah! Allah!

1149
02:10:14,166 --> 02:10:17,325
Thank you, my Allah

1150
02:10:18,406 --> 02:10:22,805
-Allah!
-Stop!

1151
02:10:25,166 --> 02:10:31,125
-Stop, you crazy.
-No! We won't wait anymore.

1152
02:10:32,086 --> 02:10:36,205
I will talk to my father. We'll go talk to your father.

1153
02:10:55,326 --> 02:10:58,085
Trails stop here.

1154
02:10:58,366 --> 02:10:59,805
-Karaali.
-My Shahzade.

1155
02:10:59,806 --> 02:11:02,725
You got that way. Oguz Alp, you go that way.

1156
02:11:02,806 --> 02:11:06,165
Don't come back without trails!

1157
02:11:22,006 --> 02:11:24,925
Where are you, Holofira?

1158
02:11:25,326 --> 02:11:29,325
-Where are you?
-My Shahzade.

1159
02:11:30,046 --> 02:11:34,045
I found this a little ahead, up there.

1160
02:11:34,766 --> 02:11:38,085
Holofira's dagger. You found it there?

1161
02:11:38,166 --> 02:11:41,645
-That way.
-Alps, let's go!

1162
02:12:00,806 --> 02:12:06,125
-Holofira!
-Orhan! Don't come! Trap!

1163
02:12:17,446 --> 02:12:21,885
Osman's baby! I knew you'd come after me.

1164
02:12:21,966 --> 02:12:25,525
Surrender so both you...

1165
02:12:25,966 --> 02:12:28,965
..and your woman will live.

1166
02:12:30,326 --> 02:12:35,125
I'd rather die than surrender to a dog like you!

1167
02:12:35,126 --> 02:12:39,685
Nokers, I want Orhan alive. Attack!

1168
02:12:50,606 --> 02:12:56,285
Orhan... You will never give up, will you?

1169
02:13:49,126 --> 02:13:52,445
-Orhan!
-Holofira!

1170
02:14:03,286 --> 02:14:06,805
You dog, I will come after you.

1171
02:14:06,886 --> 02:14:11,685
I will take first the hatun and then your head!

1172
02:14:11,766 --> 02:14:15,285
Yes, yes... A dog can only be tested with a dog.

1173
02:14:15,366 --> 02:14:18,285
You aren't even equal to my dog.

1174
02:14:18,446 --> 02:14:21,605
Nokers, tie her up.

1175
02:14:25,526 --> 02:14:28,885
Holofira.

1176
02:15:01,726 --> 02:15:04,245
Princess.

1177
02:15:04,726 --> 02:15:08,965
-Amir Gorklu Khan.
-Maria.

1178
02:15:22,046 --> 02:15:26,565
Osman! Osman!

1179
02:15:39,726 --> 02:15:42,565
Osman!

1180
02:15:55,286 --> 02:15:58,405
Gorklu Khan!

1181
02:15:58,526 --> 02:16:00,965
Osman.

1182
02:16:06,606 --> 02:16:12,045
I told you! There are the predator and the prey!

1183
02:16:13,126 --> 02:16:16,765
-You are in my hunting territory.
-Osman.

1184
02:16:16,806 --> 02:16:19,245
Your impertinence is limitless.

1185
02:16:19,286 --> 02:16:25,405
Your everything belong to Ilkhanids. You will learn that.

1186
02:16:34,004 --> 02:16:39,645
Preys are mine!
Everything is mine!

1187
02:16:42,084 --> 02:16:44,805
I have...

1188
02:16:45,446 --> 02:16:49,565
...both your son and his wife Holofira.

1189
02:16:49,566 --> 02:16:52,045
What?

1190
02:17:03,606 --> 02:17:08,445
Now I will walk freely out of here.

1191
02:17:08,766 --> 02:17:14,045
And you will bring my princess to me.

1192
02:17:14,245 --> 02:17:18,285
Look at me. Look at me!

1193
02:17:20,606 --> 02:17:25,725
If they are hurt even slightly.

1194
02:17:25,726 --> 02:17:31,924
you can find no place in these lands to hide in!

1195
02:17:34,084 --> 02:17:35,725
You should know that!

1196
02:17:38,584 --> 02:17:50,284
Visit turkision.com for more!